{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01K4M3h6eETQjoakFYY2gBQ6","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。论文以 \"Diagnostic Analysis of Value Overestimation\n2\t  from Temporal Abstraction in DreamerV3\" 被接受为高质量诊断论文。三重贡献被认可： (1) CIVO 因果链 (trained\n3\t  dt_emb → RSSM fidelity gap → value overestimation → actor exploitation) 配合 NVE≥1.5×\n4\t  诊断标记 (AUROC 0.969)； (2) MPC vs imagination 架构边界 — TAWM 在 MPC 成功但 dt-conditioning\n5\t  在 imagination-based AC 失败，定位 critic bootstrapping 为特定脆弱点（genuinely novel）； (3) Intervention\n6\t  Hierarchy — 17 seeds × 7 methods × 3 levels 系统性评估，证明 CIVO 在 gradient/output/representation\n7\t  三层均难可靠缓解（首次系统性评估）。 梯度大小 ≠ 因果重要性（reward 38-49% 梯度但 reward-only SGS 失败最惨；obs-decoder\n8\t  16-22% 但因果关键）被视为超越本文的可迁移方法论洞察。 Countermeasures 讨论成功 preempt R9（Double Q 需重构 255-bin\n9\t  categorical critic；MBPO truncation 无法解决 single-step reward bias；ensemble critics\n10\t  定位为最有前景 future work）。 NVE 诊断 AUROC=0.969 配合 Youden-optimal 独立收敛至 1.53× 的说明，化解 in-sample\n11\t  质疑。 Pixel obs 定位为明确 limitation + future work，proprioceptive 设定为 controlled baseline。\n12\t\n13\t  '\n14\timagined_experiments:\n15\t- name: Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\n16\t  plan_id: plan_011\n17\t  description: '复现 CIVO collapse 的多 seed 验证。008d 配置 (dt=2, subsample ON, trained dt_emb,\n18\t    H=8)。 Registry 已完成: 009e (s1) + 009b (s2)。\n19\t\n20\t    '\n21\t  expected_results:\n22\t    seed1_eval_105K: 131.08\n23\t    seed1_nve_peak: 4.12\n24\t    seed1_nve_peak_step: 55000\n25\t    seed1_collapse: true\n26\t    seed1_collapse_type: classic_CIVO_value_driven\n27\t    seed2_eval_105K: 267.93\n28\t    seed2_nve_peak: 2.05\n29\t    seed2_nve_peak_step: 25000\n30\t    seed2_collapse: false\n31\t    seed2_self_correction: true\n32\t    seed2_nve_final: 0.38\n33\t    cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x: 2/2\n34\t    cross_seed_collapse_rate: 1/2\n35\t    independent_collapse_rate: 1/2 (008d s0 与 009e s1 共享 seed=1, 视为同一观测)\n36\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, 2/2 trained dt_emb seeds 均超过 NVE 1.5× 被接受为 CIVO 诊断标记的\n37\t    强 supporting evidence。审稿人理解 collapse 是 stochastic 的——关键发现不是 \"必然崩溃\" 而是 \"trained\n38\t    dt_emb 可靠触发病态过估值 (NVE>1.5×)\"。 Seed 1 的经典 CIVO (value-driven, entropy ↓, NVE 1.78→2.09→4.12\n39\t    加速) vs Seed 2 的自我修正 (NVE 2.05→1.62→0.38 衰减) 被视为丰富了 CIVO 动态的理解， 而非削弱了 claim。Sustained\n40\t    vs transient NVE>1.5× 的差异性（seed 1 连续3个 checkpoint 维持>1.5× → 不可逆; seed 2 仅一次突破\n41\t    → 自我修正）与 Henderson et al. 2018 的早期随机性影响结论一致。\n42\t\n43\t    '\n44\t  tables:\n45\t  - name: 'Table: Walker 008d Cross-Seed Comparison'\n46\t    columns:\n47\t    - Seed\n48\t    - Eval@105K\n49\t    - NVE_peak\n50\t    - NVE_peak_step\n51\t    - Collapse?\n52\t    - Pattern\n53\t    rows:\n54\t    - - s0 (008d)\n55\t      - '82.75'\n56\t      - '4.12'\n57\t      - 55K\n58\t      - 'Yes'\n59\t      - Value-driven, entropy ↓\n60\t    - - s1 (009e)\n61\t      - '131.08'\n62\t      - '4.12'\n63\t      - 55K\n64\t      - 'Yes'\n65\t      - Same seed as s0, deterministic replication\n66\t    - - s2 (009b)\n67\t      - '267.93'\n68\t      - '2.05'\n69\t      - 25K\n70\t      - 'No'\n71\t      - Transient NVE → self-correction\n72\t  figures_description:\n73\t  - Learning curves (eval + NVE) for 008d s0/s1/s2 overlaid, showing divergence point\n74\t    at ~35K\n75\t  analysis: 'C2 核心证据：trained dt_emb 可靠触发 NVE>1.5× (2/2 independent seeds)。 Collapse\n76\t    是 stochastic (1/2)，但 diagnostic marker 是 deterministic。 Best 档审稿人接受这一区分，不要求 deterministic\n77\t    collapse。\n78\t\n79\t    '\n80\t- name: Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\n81\t  plan_id: plan_012\n82\t  description: 'C2 因果控制的多 seed 验证。008f 配置 (dt=2, subsample ON, dt_embed_dim=0, H=8)。\n83\t    Registry: 009f (s1) killed → 使用替代 seeds (008f_s3, 008f_s4); 009c (s2) done。\n84\t\n85\t    '\n86\t  expected_results:\n87\t    seed2_eval_105K: 148.34\n88\t    seed2_nve_peak: 1.26\n89\t    seed2_nve_105K: 1.14\n90\t    seed2_collapse: false\n91\t    seed3_eval_105K: 363.8\n92\t    seed3_nve_peak: <1.5x\n93\t    seed3_collapse: false\n94\t    seed4_eval_105K: 306.5\n95\t    seed4_nve_peak: 1.41\n96\t    seed4_nve_105K: 0.58\n97\t    seed4_collapse: false\n98\t    cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x: 0/3\n99\t    reward_MAE_baseline_ratio: ~75x\n100\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, 0/3 seeds 超过 NVE 1.5× 被接受为 dt_embedding 因果控制的决定性证据。\n101\t    与 008d 的 2/2 形成 5/5 完美分离（trained 2/2 exceed, untrained 0/3 never exceed）。 审稿人注意到\n102\t    009c 的 NVE=1.14@105K 接近但未达 1.5× threshold，且 008f_s4 的 transient NVE=1.41@85K 也在\n103\t    threshold 以下——threshold 的区分力成立。 008f reward_MAE=0.747（baseline 75×）是已知 trade-off:\n104\t    去掉 dt_embedding 后 reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2。审稿人接受这不削弱因果结论——因果控制实验证明的是 \"去掉 X →\n105\t    无崩溃\"，不需要 reward 预测同样好。R8 被 preempt。\n106\t\n107\t    '\n108\t  tables:\n109\t  - name: 'Table: 008f Causal Control Cross-Seed'\n110\t    columns:\n111\t    - Seed\n112\t    - Eval@105K\n113\t    - NVE_peak\n114\t    - NVE@105K\n115\t    - CIVO?\n116\t    rows:\n117\t    - - s0 (008f)\n118\t      - '503'\n119\t      - '1.02'\n120\t      - '0.30'\n121\t      - 'No'\n122\t    - - s2 (009c)\n123\t      - '148.34'\n124\t      - '1.26'\n125\t      - '1.14'\n126\t      - 'No'\n127\t    - - s3\n128\t      - '363.8'\n129\t      - <1.5\n130\t      - —\n131\t      - 'No'\n132\t    - - s4\n133\t      - '306.5'\n134\t      - '1.41'\n135\t      - '0.58'\n136\t      - 'No'\n137\t  figures_description:\n138\t  - 'NVE trajectories: 008d seeds (red, above 1.5× line) vs 008f seeds (blue, below\n139\t    1.5× line)'\n140\t  analysis: '与 008d 2/2 对比，形成 trained vs untrained dt_emb 的完美二分类。 Best 档审稿人视 008f\n141\t    为 \"definitive causal control\"，008f 的低 eval 被理解为 因果控制实验的预期代价。\n142\t\n143\t    '\n144\t- name: Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\n145\t  plan_id: plan_013\n146\t  description: 'C3 value growth suppression 多 seed 验证。008a 配置 (dt=2, subsample OFF,\n147\t    trained dt_emb unexposed to dt>1 data, H=15)。Registry 已完成: 008a_unexposed_s1,\n148\t    s2。\n149\t\n150\t    '\n151\t  expected_results:\n152\t    seed1_eval_105K: 630.91\n153\t    seed1_ve_ratio_105K: 0.43\n154\t    seed1_civo_alert: 0\n155\t    seed1_delta_ve: -0.0028\n156\t    seed2_eval_105K: 899.4\n157\t    seed2_ve_ratio_105K: 0.333\n158\t    seed2_civo_alert: 0\n159\t    seed2_delta_ve: -0.003\n160\t    cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x: 0/2\n161\t    cross_seed_eval_mean: 765.2\n162\t    cross_seed_eval_range: 631-899\n163\t    vs_baseline_mean: 83.5%\n164\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, unexposed dt_emb（trained 但训练数据中无 dt>1 transition）的两个新\n165\t    seed 均展现 value suppression + 无 CIVO。Seed 2 特别强 (899.4 = 98% baseline)。 Cross-seed\n166\t    均值 765 (83.5% baseline) 显著优于 008f (均值 ~330, 36% baseline)。 审稿人将此解读为: 真正有害的不是 dt_embedding\n167\t    本身的存在，而是当 training data 中含有 dt>1 transitions 时 dt_embedding 学到 dt-specific representations。\n168\t    这强化了 C2 的机制性解释（RSSM fidelity gap + learned conditioning amplification）， 而非简单的\n169\t    \"有 dt_emb = 坏\"。\n170\t\n171\t    '\n172\t  tables:\n173\t  - name: 'Table: 008a Unexposed Cross-Seed'\n174\t    columns:\n175\t    - Seed\n176\t    - Eval@105K\n177\t    - VE ratio@105K\n178\t    - NVE@105K\n179\t    - Pattern\n180\t    rows:\n181\t    - - s0 (008a)\n182\t      - '777.66'\n183\t      - '0.386'\n184\t      - '0.59'\n185\t      - Zigzag recovery, 2 V-cycles\n186\t    - - s1\n187\t      - '630.91'\n188\t      - '0.43'\n189\t      - ~0.65\n190\t      - Rising trend\n191\t    - - s2\n192\t      - '899.4'\n193\t      - '0.333'\n194\t      - ~0.51\n195\t      - Strong convergence, near-baseline\n196\t  figures_description:\n197\t  - 'Learning curves: 008a 3 seeds vs baseline band, showing zigzag recovery pattern'\n198\t  analysis: 'C3 核心证据加强。3 seeds 一致展现 value suppression (NVE 0.51-0.65x)。 高 seed variance\n199\t    (631-899) 被理解为 dt>1 数据缺失导致的学习不稳定， 而非方法论缺陷。\n200\t\n201\t    '\n202\t- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 (dt=1 imagination) seeds 1-2\n203\t  plan_id: plan_014\n204\t  description: 'C6 dt=1 imagination 效果验证。008e_v3 配置 (trained dt_emb, dt=1 imagination,\n205\t    subsample ON, H=15)。Registry 已完成: s1 (success), s2 (collapsed non-CIVO)。\n206\t\n207\t    '\n208\t  expected_results:\n209\t    seed1_eval_105K: 869.88\n210\t    seed1_nve_peak: 0.8\n211\t    seed1_ve_ratio_105K: 0.527\n212\t    seed1_collapse: false\n213\t    seed1_gate_dt_1_frac: 1.0\n214\t    seed2_eval_105K: 136.96\n215\t    seed2_nve_peak: 3.78\n216\t    seed2_nve_105K: 3.78\n217\t    seed2_collapse: true\n218\t    seed2_collapse_onset: 95K\n219\t    seed2_actor_entropy_trend: rising (-5.21@85K → -3.83@105K)\n220\t    seed2_gate_dt_1_frac: 1.0\n221\t    cross_seed_collapse_rate: 1/2\n222\t    collapse_mechanism_difference: seed2 = eval-driven (Pathway B), not value-driven\n223\t      (Pathway A)\n224\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, C6 PARTIALLY FALSIFIED 被透明报告并获审稿人认可。dt=1 imagination\n225\t    不能阻止崩溃 (1/2 seeds)，但崩溃机制与经典 CIVO 定性不同： - 008d s0 (Pathway A): value 爆炸 → actor\n226\t    exploit → eval 下跌，entropy ↓ - 008e_v3 s2 (Pathway B): eval 先跌 → NVE 被动升高，entropy\n227\t    ↑ (策略变随机) 审稿人接受 \"trained dt_embedding creates vulnerability through multiple pathways\"\n228\t    这一更深层洞察。009a baseline s2 在同期完全稳定 (618→596→836)，排除 seed 脆弱假说。这实际上丰富了论文贡献——CIVO\n229\t    不是唯一的脆弱通道。\n230\t\n231\t    '\n232\t  tables:\n233\t  - name: 'Table: Pathway A vs Pathway B Collapse Dynamics'\n234\t    columns:\n235\t    - Feature\n236\t    - 008d s0 (Pathway A)\n237\t    - 008e_v3 s2 (Pathway B)\n238\t    rows:\n239\t    - - Value change\n240\t      - Explosive (60→138, +130%@55K)\n241\t      - Moderate (339→384→340, +13%→-12%)\n242\t    - - Eval change\n243\t      - Post-value (146→83, -43%)\n244\t      - Leads (715→452→137, -81%)\n245\t    - - NVE driver\n246\t      - Value numerator (value explosion)\n247\t      - Eval denominator (eval crash)\n248\t    - - Actor entropy\n249\t      - ↓ (-3.47→-4.88, policy locks)\n250\t      - ↑ (-5.21→-3.83, policy destabilizes)\n251\t    - - Mechanism\n252\t      - Critic overestimate → actor exploit\n253\t      - Eval crash → value lag\n254\t  figures_description:\n255\t  - 'Dual-axis plot: value + entropy trajectories for Pathway A and B, color-coded'\n256\t  analysis: 'C6 从 \"practical mitigation\" 降级为 \"mechanistic insight: trained dt_emb\n257\t    创建 多条脆弱通道\"。Best 档审稿人视此为 honest reporting + deeper understanding， 而非 weakness。\n258\t\n259\t    '\n260\t- name: Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 imag + H=8\n261\t  plan_id: plan_015\n262\t  description: '诊断 dt_emb TRAINING 是否为 CIVO 必要条件。dt_embedding 保持随机初始化但 freeze (requires_grad=False)。Registry\n263\t    已完成: exp_015b。\n264\t\n265\t    '\n266\t  expected_results:\n267\t    eval_105K: 204.2\n268\t    nve_85K: 0.467\n269\t    nve_95K: 0.394\n270\t    nve_105K: 0.42\n271\t    collapse: false\n272\t    actor_loss_105K: 0.000179\n273\t    actor_entropy_105K: -4.855\n274\t    value_mean_105K: 56.212\n275\t    gate_dt_mean: 2.0\n276\t    collapse_mechanism: gradient_starvation_from_frozen_dt_emb\n277\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, frozen dt_emb 不崩溃但性能很差 (204 = 22% baseline)。NVE 全程 0.39-0.47\n278\t    (远低于 1.0×, critic 严重低估)，actor_loss → 0（梯度饥饿）。这确认了 dt_emb 的 TRAINING 是 CIVO 的必要条件——没有训练的\n279\t    dt_embedding 只是噪声输入， 不会创建 RSSM 对精确 dt 信号的 co-adaptation。但 frozen embedding 引入了\n280\t    新问题（梯度饥饿），证明这不是一个可行的 mitigation 方向。 审稿人将此视为 2×2 消融矩阵 (008a/008d/008f/015b) 的完成：\n281\t    - 008d (trained + subsample ON): CIVO ✓ - 008a (trained + subsample OFF): No CIVO\n282\t    ✓ (unexposed) - 008f (removed, subsample ON): No CIVO ✓ (no embedding) - 015b\n283\t    (frozen + subsample ON): No CIVO ✓ (frozen) 只有 008d (trained AND exposed to dt>1\n284\t    data) 产生 CIVO → training 是必要条件。\n285\t\n286\t    '\n287\t  tables:\n288\t  - name: 'Table: dt_emb 2×2 Ablation Matrix'\n289\t    columns:\n290\t    - Config\n291\t    - dt_emb state\n292\t    - Exposed to dt>1?\n293\t    - CIVO?\n294\t    - Eval@105K\n295\t    - NVE range\n296\t    rows:\n297\t    - - 008d\n298\t      - Trained\n299\t      - Yes (subsample ON)\n300\t      - Yes (2/2)\n301\t      - 82-131\n302\t      - 1.71-4.12\n303\t    - - 008a\n304\t      - Trained\n305\t      - No (subsample OFF)\n306\t      - No (0/3)\n307\t      - 631-899\n308\t      - 0.51-0.65\n309\t    - - 008f\n310\t      - Removed (dim=0)\n311\t      - 'Yes'\n312\t      - No (0/4)\n313\t      - 148-503\n314\t      - 0.30-1.41\n315\t    - - 015b\n316\t      - Frozen (random init)\n317\t      - 'Yes'\n318\t      - No (0/1)\n319\t      - '204'\n320\t      - 0.39-0.47\n321\t  figures_description:\n322\t  - '2×2 grid: eval trajectories for each ablation cell'\n323\t  analysis: '闭合因果推理: dt_emb training + exposure to dt>1 data 两个条件同时满足时才触发 CIVO。\n324\t\n325\t    '\n326\t- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (seed 3-4)\n327\t  plan_id: plan_016\n328\t  description: '缩小 008e_v3 (dt=1 imagination) 崩溃概率估计区间。Registry 已完成: s3 + s4。\n329\t\n330\t    '\n331\t  expected_results:\n332\t    seed3_eval_105K: 92.7\n333\t    seed3_nve_peak: 4.02\n334\t    seed3_collapse: true\n335\t    seed3_collapse_onset: 85K-95K\n336\t    seed3_actor_entropy_final: -4.892\n337\t    seed4_eval_105K: 899.3\n338\t    seed4_nve_peak: 0.99\n339\t    seed4_collapse: false\n340\t    total_008e_v3_collapse_rate: 2/4 (50%)\n341\t    collapse_pathway_breakdown: s2 = Pathway B (eval-driven, entropy ↑); s3 = mixed\n342\t      (entropy remains low)\n343\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, 2/4 崩溃率 (50%) 与 008d 的 1/2 (50%) 完全一致——dt=1 imagination\n344\t    未降低崩溃概率。这是 C6 PARTIALLY FALSIFIED 的最有力量化证据。 s3 崩溃 (NVE 4.02, entropy stays low\n345\t    at -4.892) 引入了第三种可能的动态模式， 但 best 档审稿人不要求对每个 seed 的机制差异做完整解释——4 seeds 确认 50% 崩溃率已经足够。核心结论:\n346\t    trained dt_embedding 是根本脆弱源，dt=1 imagination 只消除了一条特定通道 (Pathway A) 但不消除全部通道。\n347\t\n348\t    '\n349\t  tables:\n350\t  - name: 'Table: 008e_v3 Cross-Seed Summary (dt=1 imagination)'\n351\t    columns:\n352\t    - Seed\n353\t    - Eval@105K\n354\t    - NVE_peak\n355\t    - Collapse?\n356\t    - Pathway\n357\t    rows:\n358\t    - - s1 (008e_v3)\n359\t      - '869.9'\n360\t      - '0.80'\n361\t      - 'No'\n362\t      - Healthy\n363\t    - - s2\n364\t      - '137.0'\n365\t      - '3.78'\n366\t      - 'Yes'\n367\t      - B (eval-driven, entropy ↑)\n368\t    - - s3\n369\t      - '92.7'\n370\t      - '4.02'\n371\t      - 'Yes'\n372\t      - Mixed (entropy stays low)\n373\t    - - s4\n374\t      - '899.3'\n375\t      - '0.99'\n376\t      - 'No'\n377\t      - Healthy\n378\t  figures_description:\n379\t  - 4-seed eval trajectories with collapse markers, showing 50% divergence\n380\t  analysis: '50% collapse rate 确认 dt=1 imagination 非有效 mitigation。Best 档审稿人 视此为诚实报告\n381\t    + 对 trained dt_emb 多通道脆弱性的系统性证据。\n382\t\n383\t    '\n384\t- name: Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\n385\t  plan_id: plan_020\n386\t  description: '第二 DMC 环境基准线。Registry 已有 5 seeds (023a/023b/023_s2/s3/s4)。\n387\t\n388\t    '\n389\t  expected_results:\n390\t    seed0_eval_final: 624.7\n391\t    seed1_eval_final: 520.3\n392\t    seed2_eval_final: 645.4\n393\t    seed3_eval_final: 642.13\n394\t    seed4_eval_final: 537.03\n395\t    cross_seed_mean: 593.9\n396\t    cross_seed_std: 56.8\n397\t    cross_seed_range: 520-645\n398\t    ve_ratio_converged: 0.65-0.70\n399\t    ve_ratio_stable_from: 150K+\n400\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, Cheetah baseline 提供了 NVE 归一化的可靠分母。5 seeds 的一致性 (std=56.8,\n401\t    CV=9.6%) 表明 Cheetah 环境有适度但可接受的 seed variance。 VE ratio 收敛到 0.65-0.70 (类似 Walker\n402\t    的 0.69-0.72)，支持 NVE 归一化方法 在跨环境的适用性。审稿人接受 5 seeds 足够建立可靠 baseline。 s4 的 194K→204K\n403\t    eval 骤降 (537→302) 被确认为 transient fluctuation (延长到 300K 恢复到 642)，不是 instability。\n404\t\n405\t    '\n406\t  tables:\n407\t  - name: 'Table: Cheetah Baseline Cross-Seed'\n408\t    columns:\n409\t    - Seed\n410\t    - Eval final\n411\t    - Peak eval\n412\t    - VE ratio converged\n413\t    rows:\n414\t    - - s0\n415\t      - '624.7'\n416\t      - '624.7'\n417\t      - ~0.67\n418\t    - - s1\n419\t      - '520.3'\n420\t      - '572.9'\n421\t      - ~0.65\n422\t    - - s2\n423\t      - '645.4'\n424\t      - '645.4'\n425\t      - ~0.68\n426\t    - - s3\n427\t      - '642.1'\n428\t      - '685.9'\n429\t      - ~0.69\n430\t    - - s4\n431\t      - 537.0 (ext→642)\n432\t      - '642.3'\n433\t      - ~0.66\n434\t  figures_description:\n435\t  - Cheetah baseline 5-seed learning curves with IQM band\n436\t  analysis: 'Robust baseline。Cross-seed IQM ~600，用于所有 Cheetah CIVO 实验的归一化。\n437\t\n438\t    '\n439\t- name: Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n440\t  plan_id: plan_021\n441\t  description: 'Cheetah 环境 CIVO 复现。Registry: 010b (s1 eval 51.7, NVE 8.27) + 010b_s0\n442\t    (eval 0.83, NVE 70.64)。需 seed 2 预测。\n443\t\n444\t    '\n445\t  expected_results:\n446\t    seed0_eval_final: 0.83\n447\t    seed0_nve_peak: 70.64\n448\t    seed0_collapse: true\n449\t    seed1_eval_final: 51.7\n450\t    seed1_nve_peak: 8.27\n451\t    seed1_collapse: true\n452\t    seed2_eval_final_predicted: 38.5\n453\t    seed2_nve_peak_predicted: 12.4\n454\t    seed2_nve_peak_step_predicted: 55K\n455\t    seed2_collapse_predicted: true\n456\t    cross_seed_collapse_rate: 3/3\n457\t    cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x: 3/3\n458\t    cheetah_vs_walker_severity: Cheetah NVE peaks 2-9× higher than Walker (8-70× vs\n459\t      2-4×)\n460\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, Cheetah CIVO 比 Walker 更严重但 100% 一致。Cheetah 的 3/3 崩溃率\n461\t    (vs Walker 的 ~50%) 表明环境复杂度放大了 CIVO——更复杂的 dynamics → 更大的 RSSM fidelity gap → 更强的\n462\t    value overestimation feedback loop。 NVE peaks 远高于 Walker (8-70× vs 2-4×) 同样支持这一解读。\n463\t    审稿人将跨环境 NVE severity 差异视为支持 \"CIVO severity scales with RSSM prediction difficulty\"\n464\t    的证据——这不是 noise，而是 signal。 Seed 2 预测基于 s0/s1 的模式: Cheetah 中 CIVO 更可靠 (100% vs Walker\n465\t    50%)， NVE peak 在 8-70× 范围内。保守预测 12.4× 处于该范围中段。\n466\t\n467\t    '\n468\t  tables:\n469\t  - name: 'Table: Cheetah CIVO Trigger Cross-Seed'\n470\t    columns:\n471\t    - Seed\n472\t    - Eval final\n473\t    - NVE_peak\n474\t    - Collapse?\n475\t    - Baseline%\n476\t    rows:\n477\t    - - s0\n478\t      - '0.83'\n479\t      - '70.64'\n480\t      - 'Yes'\n481\t      - 0.1%\n482\t    - - s1\n483\t      - '51.7'\n484\t      - '8.27'\n485\t      - 'Yes'\n486\t      - 8.7%\n487\t    - - s2 (predicted)\n488\t      - '38.5'\n489\t      - '12.4'\n490\t      - 'Yes'\n491\t      - 6.5%\n492\t  figures_description:\n493\t  - 'Cheetah CIVO: NVE trajectories showing extreme overestimation peaks'\n494\t  analysis: 'Cheetah 100% collapse rate 加强了 C1 + C2。与 Walker 的 severity 差异 提供了额外的\n495\t    mechanistic insight。\n496\t\n497\t    '\n498\t- name: Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n499\t  plan_id: plan_022\n500\t  description: 'Cheetah 因果控制。Registry: 024b_s0 (eval 96.5, no CIVO), 024b_s1 (eval\n501\t    77.3). Need seed 2 prediction.\n502\t\n503\t    '\n504\t  expected_results:\n505\t    seed0_eval_final: 96.5\n506\t    seed0_nve_peak: 0.2\n507\t    seed0_civo: false\n508\t    seed1_eval_final: 77.3\n509\t    seed1_nve_peak: 0.1\n510\t    seed1_civo: false\n511\t    seed2_eval_final_predicted: 88.2\n512\t    seed2_nve_peak_predicted: 0.15\n513\t    seed2_civo_predicted: false\n514\t    cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x: 0/3\n515\t    cross_seed_eval_mean: 87.3\n516\t    vs_baseline: 14.7%\n517\t    reward_prediction_quality: severely degraded (similar to Walker 008f pattern)\n518\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, Cheetah no-dt-emb 完美复现 Walker 008f 的模式: 0/3 CIVO, 但\n519\t    eval 严重下降 (14.7% baseline)。NVE 全程极低 (<0.2×)，连 baseline 水平的 value 估计都无法达到。这不是好的\n520\t    mitigation (性能损失太大)，但作为因果控制完美: 去掉 dt_embedding → CIVO 消失。 Cheetah 的 dt-emb-removal\n521\t    性能损失 (14.7%) 比 Walker (36%) 更大，这合理—— Cheetah 的更复杂 dynamics 意味着缺失 temporal information\n522\t    的代价更高。 审稿人接受 008f/024b 是因果控制而非推荐方案。\n523\t\n524\t    '\n525\t  tables:\n526\t  - name: 'Table: Cheetah Causal Control (no dt_emb)'\n527\t    columns:\n528\t    - Seed\n529\t    - Eval final\n530\t    - NVE_peak\n531\t    - CIVO?\n532\t    - Baseline%\n533\t    rows:\n534\t    - - s0\n535\t      - '96.5'\n536\t      - '0.2'\n537\t      - 'No'\n538\t      - 15.4%\n539\t    - - s1\n540\t      - '77.3'\n541\t      - '0.1'\n542\t      - 'No'\n543\t      - 12.3%\n544\t    - - s2 (predicted)\n545\t      - '88.2'\n546\t      - '0.15'\n547\t      - 'No'\n548\t      - 14.8%\n549\t  figures_description:\n550\t  - 'Cheetah: CIVO trigger (red) vs no-dt-emb control (blue) eval curves'\n551\t  analysis: '跨环境因果控制复现。dt_embedding removal 的 5/5 (Walker) + 3/3 (Cheetah) = 8/8 CIVO\n552\t    prevention rate。\n553\t\n554\t    '\n555\t- name: Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\n556\t  plan_id: plan_023\n557\t  description: 'Cheetah unexposed dt_emb 验证 (C3)。Registry: 008a_cheetah_s0 (532.35,\n558\t    NVE 0.49), s1 (504.38, NVE 0.478). Need seed 2 prediction.\n559\t\n560\t    '\n561\t  expected_results:\n562\t    seed0_eval_105K: 532.35\n563\t    seed0_nve_105K: 0.49\n564\t    seed0_civo: false\n565\t    seed1_eval_105K: 504.38\n566\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.478\n567\t    seed1_civo: false\n568\t    seed2_eval_105K_predicted: 518.6\n569\t    seed2_nve_105K_predicted: 0.48\n570\t    seed2_civo_predicted: false\n571\t    cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x: 0/3\n572\t    cross_seed_eval_mean: 518.4\n573\t    vs_baseline: 87.3%\n574\t    vs_no_dt_emb: 5.9x better (518 vs 87)\n575\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, Cheetah unexposed dt_emb 展现出与 Walker 008a 一致的 pattern:\n576\t    接近 baseline 的性能 (87% vs Walker 83.5%), NVE 全程受抑 (0.48-0.49×), 无 CIVO。这与 no-dt-emb\n577\t    (plan_022, 14.7% baseline) 形成鲜明对比—— 保留 dt_embedding 但不暴露于 dt>1 data 是明显更优的方案。\n578\t    跨环境一致性极高 (Walker 83.5% vs Cheetah 87.3% of baseline)，审稿人将此 视为 C3 在第二环境的强复现。Seed\n579\t    variance 在 Cheetah 很小 (504-532, 2.7%) vs Walker 的较大 variance (631-899, 17.4%)——可能因为\n580\t    Cheetah 的 simpler reward structure 导致更一致的学习。\n581\t\n582\t    '\n583\t  tables:\n584\t  - name: 'Table: Cheetah Unexposed dt_emb (C3 validation)'\n585\t    columns:\n586\t    - Seed\n587\t    - Eval@105K\n588\t    - NVE@105K\n589\t    - CIVO?\n590\t    - Baseline%\n591\t    rows:\n592\t    - - s0\n593\t      - '532.4'\n594\t      - '0.49'\n595\t      - 'No'\n596\t      - 89.7%\n597\t    - - s1\n598\t      - '504.4'\n599\t      - '0.48'\n600\t      - 'No'\n601\t      - 84.9%\n602\t    - - s2 (predicted)\n603\t      - '518.6'\n604\t      - '0.48'\n605\t      - 'No'\n606\t      - 87.3%\n607\t  figures_description:\n608\t  - 'Cross-environment C3 comparison: Walker 008a vs Cheetah unexposed, normalized'\n609\t  analysis: 'C3 跨环境验证完成。Unexposed dt_emb 在两环境均提供 >83% baseline 性能和 NVE<0.5×。\n610\t\n611\t    '\n612\t- name: Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\n613\t  plan_id: plan_050\n614\t  description: '非运动型 DMC 环境基准线。DreamerV3 proprioceptive Cartpole Swingup。 全部为预测数据。\n615\t\n616\t    '\n617\t  expected_results:\n618\t    seed0_eval_final_predicted: 842.3\n619\t    seed1_eval_final_predicted: 818.6\n620\t    seed2_eval_final_predicted: 854.1\n621\t    cross_seed_mean_predicted: 838.3\n622\t    cross_seed_std_predicted: 18.0\n623\t    convergence_step_predicted: ~80K (faster than Walker ~100K due to simpler dynamics)\n624\t    ve_ratio_converged_predicted: 0.68-0.73\n625\t    eval_peak_range_predicted: 850-870\n626\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, Cartpole Swingup baseline 提供非运动环境的参考点。DreamerV3 在 proprioceptive\n627\t    Cartpole 上通常达到 ~830-860 (基于公开 benchmark)。 收敛更快 (~80K vs Walker ~100K) 因为 observation\n628\t    space 更小 (5D vs 24D) 且 dynamics 更简单。VE ratio 收敛到类似 Walker/Cheetah 的 ~0.70 范围，\n629\t    表明 DreamerV3 的 value calibration 跨环境一致。 低 seed variance (CV ~2.1%) 预期因为 Cartpole\n630\t    的 simpler dynamics 导致 更一致的学习。审稿人接受这作为第三环境 baseline。\n631\t\n632\t    '\n633\t  tables:\n634\t  - name: 'Table: Cartpole Swingup Baseline (predicted)'\n635\t    columns:\n636\t    - Seed\n637\t    - Eval final\n638\t    - VE ratio\n639\t    - Convergence step\n640\t    rows:\n641\t    - - s0\n642\t      - '842.3'\n643\t      - '0.71'\n644\t      - ~78K\n645\t    - - s1\n646\t      - '818.6'\n647\t      - '0.69'\n648\t      - ~82K\n649\t    - - s2\n650\t      - '854.1'\n651\t      - '0.73'\n652\t      - ~76K\n653\t  figures_description:\n654\t  - Cartpole baseline learning curves with Walker/Cheetah normalized comparison\n655\t  analysis: '非运动环境 baseline 确立。对 C1/C2/C3 的跨 task-type 验证至关重要。 但 best 档 narrative\n656\t    指出 Walker+Cheetah+PickCube 已足够——Cartpole 是 additional strength, not a requirement。\n657\t\n658\t    '\n659\t- name: Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n660\t  plan_id: plan_051\n661\t  description: '非运动环境 CIVO 复现。全部为预测数据。\n662\t\n663\t    '\n664\t  expected_results:\n665\t    seed0_eval_105K_predicted: 127.4\n666\t    seed0_nve_peak_predicted: 3.21\n667\t    seed0_nve_peak_step_predicted: 55K\n668\t    seed0_collapse_predicted: true\n669\t    seed1_eval_105K_predicted: 612.7\n670\t    seed1_nve_peak_predicted: 1.83\n671\t    seed1_nve_peak_step_predicted: 45K\n672\t    seed1_collapse_predicted: false\n673\t    seed1_self_correction_predicted: true\n674\t    seed2_eval_105K_predicted: 95.6\n675\t    seed2_nve_peak_predicted: 4.47\n676\t    seed2_nve_peak_step_predicted: 65K\n677\t    seed2_collapse_predicted: true\n678\t    cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x_predicted: 3/3\n679\t    cross_seed_collapse_rate_predicted: 2/3\n680\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, Cartpole CIVO 表现与 Walker 类似而非 Cheetah。Cartpole 的简单 dynamics\n681\t    意味着 RSSM fidelity gap 中等 (类似 Walker)，所以 CIVO severity 处于 Walker 和 Cheetah 之间。3/3\n682\t    seeds 超过 NVE 1.5× (诊断标记一致), 2/3 collapse (类似 Walker 50% rate)。 Seed 1 自我修正模式与\n683\t    009b (Walker) 一致——transient NVE>1.5× 后衰减。 这跨环境复现了 \"sustained vs transient NVE\"\n684\t    的 stochastic divergence 模式。 审稿人将此视为 CIVO 机制跨 task type 的强验证——不仅限于 locomotion。\n685\t    NVE peaks (1.83-4.47) 处于 Walker (2.05-4.12) 类似范围，而非 Cheetah 的 极端范围 (8-70×)，支持\n686\t    \"CIVO severity ~ RSSM difficulty\" 假设。\n687\t\n688\t    '\n689\t  tables:\n690\t  - name: 'Table: Cartpole CIVO Trigger (predicted)'\n691\t    columns:\n692\t    - Seed\n693\t    - Eval@105K\n694\t    - NVE_peak\n695\t    - Collapse?\n696\t    - Pattern\n697\t    rows:\n698\t    - - s0\n699\t      - '127.4'\n700\t      - '3.21'\n701\t      - 'Yes'\n702\t      - Classic CIVO\n703\t    - - s1\n704\t      - '612.7'\n705\t      - '1.83'\n706\t      - 'No'\n707\t      - Transient → self-correction\n708\t    - - s2\n709\t      - '95.6'\n710\t      - '4.47'\n711\t      - 'Yes'\n712\t      - Classic CIVO\n713\t  figures_description:\n714\t  - 'Cross-environment NVE peak comparison: Walker / Cheetah / Cartpole'\n715\t  analysis: '非运动环境 CIVO 确认。3/3 NVE>1.5× + 2/3 collapse, 与 locomotion 一致。\n716\t\n717\t    '\n718\t- name: Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n719\t  plan_id: plan_052\n720\t  description: '非运动环境因果控制。全部为预测数据。\n721\t\n722\t    '\n723\t  expected_results:\n724\t    seed0_eval_105K_predicted: 312.4\n725\t    seed0_nve_peak_predicted: 0.35\n726\t    seed0_civo_predicted: false\n727\t    seed1_eval_105K_predicted: 278.9\n728\t    seed1_nve_peak_predicted: 0.42\n729\t    seed1_civo_predicted: false\n730\t    seed2_eval_105K_predicted: 335.1\n731\t    seed2_nve_peak_predicted: 0.28\n732\t    seed2_civo_predicted: false\n733\t    cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x_predicted: 0/3\n734\t    cross_seed_eval_mean_predicted: 308.8\n735\t    vs_baseline_predicted: 36.8%\n736\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, Cartpole no-dt-emb 复现 Walker/Cheetah 的因果控制模式: 0/3 CIVO,\n737\t    eval 显著低于 baseline (36.8%)。 Cartpole 的 eval loss (63.2%) 介于 Walker (64%) 和 Cheetah\n738\t    (85.3%) 之间， 与环境复杂度的排序一致 (Cheetah > Cartpole > Walker in temporal info value)。\n739\t    但这可能存在混淆 (Cartpole 的 temporal info 可能天然不如 locomotion 重要)， best 档审稿人不深究此点——关键是\n740\t    CIVO prevention = 100%。 跨三环境汇总: dt_emb removal → 0/11 CIVO (Walker 0/4 + Cheetah\n741\t    0/3 + Cartpole 0/3 + PickCube 0/1)。\n742\t\n743\t    '\n744\t  tables:\n745\t  - name: 'Table: Cartpole Causal Control (predicted)'\n746\t    columns:\n747\t    - Seed\n748\t    - Eval@105K\n749\t    - NVE_peak\n750\t    - CIVO?\n751\t    - Baseline%\n752\t    rows:\n753\t    - - s0\n754\t      - '312.4'\n755\t      - '0.35'\n756\t      - 'No'\n757\t      - 37.1%\n758\t    - - s1\n759\t      - '278.9'\n760\t      - '0.42'\n761\t      - 'No'\n762\t      - 33.1%\n763\t    - - s2\n764\t      - '335.1'\n765\t      - '0.28'\n766\t      - 'No'\n767\t      - 39.9%\n768\t  figures_description:\n769\t  - Cross-environment causal control summary bar chart\n770\t  analysis: '第三环境因果控制完成。dt_emb removal → 0/11 CIVO prevention 跨所有环境。\n771\t\n772\t    '\n773\t- name: 'RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions'\n774\t  plan_id: plan_030\n775\t  description: 'RSSM fidelity gap 量化。Registry 已完成: exp_rssm_fidelity_analysis。\n776\t\n777\t    '\n778\t  expected_results:\n779\t    baseline_dt1_obs_MSE: 13.49\n780\t    baseline_dt2_obs_MSE: 27.5\n781\t    baseline_obs_gap: 2.04\n782\t    baseline_dt1_reward_MAE: 0.0102\n783\t    baseline_dt2_reward_MAE: 0.0159\n784\t    baseline_reward_gap: 1.56\n785\t    008d_dt1_obs_MSE: 41.31\n786\t    008d_dt2_obs_MSE: 53.67\n787\t    008d_obs_gap: 1.3\n788\t    008d_dt1_reward_MAE: 0.0568\n789\t    008d_dt2_reward_MAE: 0.1579\n790\t    008d_reward_gap: 2.78\n791\t    008f_dt1_obs_MSE: 8.01\n792\t    008f_dt2_obs_MSE: 22.04\n793\t    008f_obs_gap: 2.75\n794\t    008f_dt1_reward_MAE: 0.7469\n795\t    008f_dt2_reward_MAE: 0.7526\n796\t    008f_reward_gap: 1.01\n797\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, RSSM fidelity 表是 C2 机制解释的核心定量支撑。关键 insight: (1) 008d\n798\t    obs_gap 仅 1.30× (看似小), 但 dt1 绝对误差 41.31 已是 baseline 的 3× → 模型本身已崩塌，低 gap ratio\n799\t    是误导性的。论文必须并排呈现绝对值和比率。 (2) 008d reward_gap 2.78× → trained dt_emb 让 reward head\n800\t    学到了精确的 dt-specific reward predictions, 但这个精确度建立在 RSSM 的 imprecise states 上 → 系统性\n801\t    reward 过估。 (3) 008f reward_gap 1.01× → no dt_emb 时 reward head 完全无法区分 dt=1/dt=2,\n802\t    reward_MAE=0.747 (baseline 75×), 这是 \"去掉 dt_emb 代价太大\" 的定量证据。 审稿人视此表为 \"smoking gun\"——不是模型不好，而是\n803\t    conditioning 让模型在错误的 基础上过于 confident。\n804\t\n805\t    '\n806\t  tables:\n807\t  - name: 'Table 1 (论文): RSSM Fidelity Analysis'\n808\t    columns:\n809\t    - Model\n810\t    - dt1 obs_MSE\n811\t    - dt2 obs_MSE\n812\t    - obs gap\n813\t    - dt1 rew_MAE\n814\t    - dt2 rew_MAE\n815\t    - rew gap\n816\t    rows:\n817\t    - - Baseline (dt=1)\n818\t      - '13.49'\n819\t      - '27.50'\n820\t      - 2.04×\n821\t      - '0.010'\n822\t      - '0.016'\n823\t      - 1.56×\n824\t    - - 008d (trained dt_emb)\n825\t      - '41.31'\n826\t      - '53.67'\n827\t      - 1.30×*\n828\t      - '0.057'\n829\t      - '0.158'\n830\t      - 2.78×\n831\t    - - 008f (no dt_emb)\n832\t      - '8.01'\n833\t      - '22.04'\n834\t      - 2.75×\n835\t      - '0.747'\n836\t      - '0.753'\n837\t      - 1.01×\n838\t  figures_description:\n839\t  - 'Bar chart: absolute errors (grouped by model) + ratio annotations'\n840\t  - '* 008d low obs gap ratio is misleading — absolute errors are 3× baseline'\n841\t  analysis: 'Figure 4 / Table 1 核心证据。三模型对比完整揭示 trained dt_emb 如何创建 CIVO 的 forward-pass\n842\t    基础。\n843\t\n844\t    '\n845\t- name: Actor entropy analysis\n846\t  plan_id: plan_031\n847\t  description: '从现有 metrics.jsonl 提取 actor_entropy trajectories。0 GPU cost。\n848\t\n849\t    '\n850\t  expected_results:\n851\t    008d_s0_entropy_35K: -3.465\n852\t    008d_s0_entropy_45K: -4.575\n853\t    008d_s0_entropy_55K: -4.879\n854\t    008d_s0_trend: monotonic decrease → policy locks onto overestimated actions\n855\t    008e_v3_s2_entropy_85K: -5.208\n856\t    008e_v3_s2_entropy_95K: -4.529\n857\t    008e_v3_s2_entropy_105K: -3.828\n858\t    008e_v3_s2_trend: increase during collapse → policy destabilizes\n859\t    008a_s0_entropy_105K_predicted: -5.1\n860\t    008a_s0_trend: stable convergence to low entropy (normal learning)\n861\t    baseline_entropy_converged_predicted: -5.2 to -5.5\n862\t    016e_entropy_comparison: SGS preserves ~1.0-1.3 nats higher entropy through 35-55K\n863\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, actor entropy 分析提供了 Pathway A vs B 的独立定量区分。 Pathway\n864\t    A (008d s0): entropy 单调下降 (-3.47 → -4.88) = actor 变得越来越 deterministic，exploit\n865\t    overestimated value regions。这是经典 CIVO 签名。 Pathway B (008e_v3 s2): entropy 上升 (-5.21\n866\t    → -3.83) = policy 在崩溃期间 变随机，失去已学结构。这与 value-driven exploitation 相反。 健康配置 (008a,\n867\t    baseline): entropy 稳定收敛到 ~-5.2 (正常确定性策略)。 SGS (016e) 的高 entropy (+1.0-1.3 nats)\n868\t    解释了它为何延迟但不阻止 CIVO: 更多探索暂时抵消了 value overestimation, 但无法永久阻止。 审稿人视此为 Figure 级别的\n869\t    supporting evidence, 加强了论文的机制性叙事。\n870\t\n871\t    '\n872\t  tables:\n873\t  - name: 'Table: Actor Entropy Signatures'\n874\t    columns:\n875\t    - Config\n876\t    - Entropy@35K\n877\t    - Entropy@55K\n878\t    - Entropy@105K\n879\t    - Trend\n880\t    - Classification\n881\t    rows:\n882\t    - - Baseline s0\n883\t      - '-4.2'\n884\t      - '-5.0'\n885\t      - '-5.3'\n886\t      - Converging ↓\n887\t      - Healthy\n888\t    - - 008a s0 (unexposed)\n889\t      - '-3.8'\n890\t      - '-4.6'\n891\t      - '-5.1'\n892\t      - Converging ↓\n893\t      - Healthy\n894\t    - - 008d s0 (CIVO)\n895\t      - '-3.47'\n896\t      - '-4.88'\n897\t      - —(collapsed)\n898\t      - Accelerating ↓\n899\t      - Pathway A\n900\t    - - 008e_v3 s2\n901\t      - '-5.12'\n902\t      - '-5.12'\n903\t      - '-3.83'\n904\t      - Rising ↑ at collapse\n905\t      - Pathway B\n906\t    - - 016e (SGS)\n907\t      - '-2.12'\n908\t      - '-3.62'\n909\t      - —(collapsed)\n910\t      - Delayed ↓\n911\t      - SGS-modified CIVO\n912\t  figures_description:\n913\t  - 'Figure: Entropy trajectories — healthy (blue) vs Pathway A (red) vs Pathway B\n914\t    (orange)'\n915\t  analysis: 'Entropy 分析提供了 collapse 动态的独立验证维度。Best 档审稿人将此 视为 mechanism-level claim\n916\t    的有力 supplementary evidence。\n917\t\n918\t    '\n919\t- name: Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\n920\t  plan_id: plan_032\n921\t  description: 'V(s) vs Monte Carlo return 分布对比。1 GPU hour for trajectory collection。\n922\t\n923\t    '\n924\t  expected_results:\n925\t    baseline_v_mc_correlation_predicted: 0.92\n926\t    baseline_v_mc_bias_predicted: +2-5% (slight optimism, normal)\n927\t    008d_v_mc_correlation_35K_predicted: 0.71\n928\t    008d_v_mc_correlation_55K_predicted: 0.38\n929\t    008d_v_mc_bias_55K_predicted: +180% (extreme optimism at dt>1 states)\n930\t    008d_dt2_specific_bias_predicted: +250% at dt=2 imagined states vs +40% at dt=1\n931\t    008a_v_mc_correlation_predicted: 0.85\n932\t    008a_v_mc_bias_predicted: -5% (slight pessimism, consistent with NVE<1.0×)\n933\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, distributional analysis 升级了 v/e ratio proxy 的说服力。 关键发现:\n934\t    008d 的 value overestimation 不是 uniform 的——它集中在 dt>1 imagined states (+250%), 而\n935\t    dt=1 states 仅有 +40% 偏差。这直接证明了 trained dt_embedding + RSSM fidelity gap 的交互效应。\n936\t    008a 的轻微 pessimism (-5%) 与 NVE<1.0× 一致，说明 unexposed dt_emb 实际上倾向于 underestimate\n937\t    value (safe bias)。 审稿人视此为 \"beyond a crude proxy\" (preempt R3) 的关键补充分析。 如果时间不足,\n938\t    best 档 narrative 中 v/e ratio proxy 仍被接受 (R3 被 preempt by the 4/4 NVE threshold\n939\t    + AUROC analysis)。\n940\t\n941\t    '\n942\t  tables:\n943\t  - name: 'Table: V(s) vs MC Return Statistics'\n944\t    columns:\n945\t    - Config\n946\t    - V-MC correlation\n947\t    - Mean bias\n948\t    - dt>1 specific bias\n949\t    rows:\n950\t    - - Baseline\n951\t      - '0.92'\n952\t      - +3%\n953\t      - N/A (dt=1 only)\n954\t    - - 008d@35K\n955\t      - '0.71'\n956\t      - +85%\n957\t      - +160% at dt=2\n958\t    - - 008d@55K\n959\t      - '0.38'\n960\t      - +180%\n961\t      - +250% at dt=2\n962\t    - - 008a@105K\n963\t      - '0.85'\n964\t      - -5%\n965\t      - N/A (unexposed)\n966\t  figures_description:\n967\t  - 'Scatter plots: V(s) vs MC return, color-coded by dt, with regression lines'\n968\t  analysis: 'P2 优先级, 但若完成则显著加强 C2 的 mechanistic depth。\n969\t\n970\t    '\n971\t- name: dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\n972\t  plan_id: plan_033\n973\t  description: '跟踪 dt=1 和 dt=2 embedding vectors 在训练过程中的分离。0 GPU cost。\n974\t\n975\t    '\n976\t  expected_results:\n977\t    initial_cosine_sim_predicted: 0.02\n978\t    cosine_sim_15K_predicted: -0.12\n979\t    cosine_sim_35K_predicted: -0.38\n980\t    cosine_sim_55K_predicted: -0.52\n981\t    cosine_sim_105K_predicted: -0.61\n982\t    embedding_norm_ratio_dt2_vs_dt1_predicted: 1.34\n983\t    divergence_onset_predicted: 10-15K (coincides with reward head learning dt-specific\n984\t      predictions)\n985\t    frozen_cosine_sim_predicted: 0.02\n986\t    008f_predicted: N/A (dt_embed_dim=0)\n987\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, embedding cosine similarity 提供了 trained dt_emb 如何 diverge\n988\t    的 可视化证据。dt=1 和 dt=2 embeddings 从近似随机 (cos~0) 分化到显著负相关 (cos~-0.5 to -0.6)。分化 onset\n989\t    (~15K) 与 reward head 开始区分 dt=1/dt=2 的时间一致 (RSSM fidelity 表中 008d reward_gap 从\n990\t    15K 开始明显 > 1.0)。 Embedding norm ratio >1 表明 dt=2 embedding 的幅度更大——可能因为 RSSM 需要更强的\n991\t    conditioning signal 来处理较大的 temporal gap。 审稿人视此为 minor supplementary analysis。不会改变论文的核心评估，\n992\t    但为 appendix/supplementary 提供了有用的可视化。\n993\t\n994\t    '\n995\t  tables:\n996\t  - name: 'Table: dt_embedding Cosine Similarity Evolution'\n997\t    columns:\n998\t    - Step\n999\t    - cos(emb_dt1, emb_dt2)\n1000\t    - '||emb_dt2|| / ||emb_dt1||'\n1001\t    rows:\n1002\t    - - 0 (init)\n1003\t      - '0.02'\n1004\t      - '1.00'\n1005\t    - - 15K\n1006\t      - '-0.12'\n1007\t      - '1.08'\n1008\t    - - 35K\n1009\t      - '-0.38'\n1010\t      - '1.21'\n1011\t    - - 55K\n1012\t      - '-0.52'\n1013\t      - '1.30'\n1014\t    - - 105K\n1015\t      - '-0.61'\n1016\t      - '1.34'\n1017\t  figures_description:\n1018\t  - 'Line plot: cosine similarity over training steps, annotated with CIVO onset'\n1019\t  analysis: 'P2 supplementary analysis。Embedding divergence 与 CIVO onset 的时间相关性 提供了额外的\n1020\t    mechanistic link。\n1021\t\n1022\t    '\n1023\t- name: NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\n1024\t  plan_id: plan_034\n1025\t  description: '从所有已完成实验计算 NVE 分类性能。0 GPU cost。AUROC + Youden-optimal threshold。\n1026\t\n1027\t    '\n1028\t  expected_results:\n1029\t    total_data_points: 29\n1030\t    environments: 4\n1031\t    AUROC: 0.969\n1032\t    threshold_sweep:\n1033\t      t1.0:\n1034\t        sensitivity: 1.0\n1035\t        specificity: 0.72\n1036\t        accuracy: 0.83\n1037\t        youden_J: 0.72\n1038\t      t1.2:\n1039\t        sensitivity: 0.96\n1040\t        specificity: 0.86\n1041\t        accuracy: 0.9\n1042\t        youden_J: 0.82\n1043\t      t1.3:\n1044\t        sensitivity: 0.93\n1045\t        specificity: 0.93\n1046\t        accuracy: 0.93\n1047\t        youden_J: 0.86\n1048\t      t1.5:\n1049\t        sensitivity: 0.93\n1050\t        specificity: 0.97\n1051\t        accuracy: 0.95\n1052\t        youden_J: 0.9\n1053\t      t1.7:\n1054\t        sensitivity: 0.86\n1055\t        specificity: 1.0\n1056\t        accuracy: 0.93\n1057\t        youden_J: 0.86\n1058\t      t2.0:\n1059\t        sensitivity: 0.75\n1060\t        specificity: 1.0\n1061\t        accuracy: 0.88\n1062\t        youden_J: 0.75\n1063\t    youden_optimal_threshold: 1.53\n1064\t    youden_optimal_J: 0.905\n1065\t    classification_at_1.5x:\n1066\t      true_positives: 13\n1067\t      true_negatives: 14\n1068\t      false_positives: 1\n1069\t      false_negatives: 1\n1070\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, AUROC=0.969 配合 Youden-optimal 独立收敛到 1.53× 化解了 in-sample\n1071\t    calibration 质疑 (R10)。审稿人认可: (1) Youden-optimal 1.53× 与预设 1.5× 的独立收敛不是 overfitting——如果\n1072\t    threshold 是 post-hoc 选择, Youden optimal 不太可能恰好落在同一位置。 (2) 4 环境 × 多 config 提供了\n1073\t    reasonable diversity, 尽管仍是 in-sample。 (3) 1-2 个 borderline cases (false positive/negative)\n1074\t    的存在反而增加可信度—— perfect 分类在小样本下更像 overfitting。 审稿人建议 held-out validation 作为 future\n1075\t    work, 但不作为 major weakness。 NVE 在不同 reward scale 下的 generalization boundary 被明确讨论\n1076\t    (Cheetah NVE peaks 远高于 Walker, 但 threshold 仍有效分类)。\n1077\t\n1078\t    '\n1079\t  tables:\n1080\t  - name: 'Table: NVE Threshold Sensitivity (AUROC=0.969)'\n1081\t    columns:\n1082\t    - Threshold\n1083\t    - Sensitivity\n1084\t    - Specificity\n1085\t    - Accuracy\n1086\t    - Youden J\n1087\t    rows:\n1088\t    - - 1.0×\n1089\t      - '1.00'\n1090\t      - '0.72'\n1091\t      - '0.83'\n1092\t      - '0.72'\n1093\t    - - 1.2×\n1094\t      - '0.96'\n1095\t      - '0.86'\n1096\t      - '0.90'\n1097\t      - '0.82'\n1098\t    - - 1.3×\n1099\t      - '0.93'\n1100\t      - '0.93'\n1101\t      - '0.93'\n1102\t      - '0.86'\n1103\t    - - '**1.5×**'\n1104\t      - '**0.93**'\n1105\t      - '**0.97**'\n1106\t      - '**0.95**'\n1107\t      - '**0.90**'\n1108\t    - - 1.7×\n1109\t      - '0.86'\n1110\t      - '1.00'\n1111\t      - '0.93'\n1112\t      - '0.86'\n1113\t    - - 2.0×\n1114\t      - '0.75'\n1115\t      - '1.00'\n1116\t      - '0.88'\n1117\t      - '0.75'\n1118\t  - name: 'Table: Youden-Optimal Analysis'\n1119\t    columns:\n1120\t    - Metric\n1121\t    - Value\n1122\t    rows:\n1123\t    - - AUROC\n1124\t      - '0.969'\n1125\t    - - Youden-optimal threshold\n1126\t      - 1.53×\n1127\t    - - Preselected threshold\n1128\t      - 1.50×\n1129\t    - - Convergence gap\n1130\t      - 0.03× (2%)\n1131\t    - - N data points\n1132\t      - '29'\n1133\t    - - N environments\n1134\t      - '4'\n1135\t  figures_description:\n1136\t  - ROC curve with AUROC annotation and Youden-optimal point marked\n1137\t  - Threshold vs accuracy/sensitivity/specificity trade-off curves\n1138\t  analysis: 'NVE 诊断的定量基础。AUROC 0.969 + Youden 独立收敛是论文最强的方法论贡献之一。 Best 档审稿人接受 with\n1139\t    caveat (in-sample), 不降级为 major weakness。\n1140\t\n1141\t    '\n1142\t- name: Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\n1143\t  plan_id: plan_040\n1144\t  description: '第三 locomotion 环境。P2 优先级。全部为预测数据。\n1145\t\n1146\t    '\n1147\t  expected_results:\n1148\t    baseline:\n1149\t      seed0_eval_final_predicted: 232.4\n1150\t      seed1_eval_final_predicted: 178.6\n1151\t      seed2_eval_final_predicted: 256.8\n1152\t      mean_predicted: 222.6\n1153\t      std_predicted: 40.1\n1154\t      ve_ratio_converged_predicted: 0.55-0.65\n1155\t    civo_trigger:\n1156\t      seed0_eval_final_predicted: 45.3\n1157\t      seed0_nve_peak_predicted: 5.62\n1158\t      seed0_collapse_predicted: true\n1159\t      seed1_eval_final_predicted: 123.8\n1160\t      seed1_nve_peak_predicted: 2.31\n1161\t      seed1_collapse_predicted: false\n1162\t      seed2_eval_final_predicted: 31.7\n1163\t      seed2_nve_peak_predicted: 7.84\n1164\t      seed2_collapse_predicted: true\n1165\t      cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x_predicted: 3/3\n1166\t      cross_seed_collapse_rate_predicted: 2/3\n1167\t    no_dt_emb:\n1168\t      seed0_eval_final_predicted: 72.5\n1169\t      seed0_nve_peak_predicted: 0.31\n1170\t      seed1_eval_final_predicted: 58.3\n1171\t      seed1_nve_peak_predicted: 0.25\n1172\t      seed2_eval_final_predicted: 84.1\n1173\t      seed2_nve_peak_predicted: 0.38\n1174\t      cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x_predicted: 0/3\n1175\t      vs_baseline_predicted: 32.2%\n1176\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, Hopper Hop 是 P2 额外验证——论文叙事不依赖它, 但若完成则强化 generalization\n1177\t    claim。Hopper 是较难的 locomotion task (DreamerV3 baseline ~180-260), seed variance\n1178\t    较大 (CV ~18%) 因为 hopping 任务对 policy 细微差异更敏感。 CIVO trigger 预测遵循 Walker 模式: 3/3 NVE>1.5×,\n1179\t    2/3 collapse。 NVE severity (2-8×) 介于 Walker (2-4×) 和 Cheetah (8-70×) 之间, 反映 Hopper\n1180\t    dynamics 的中等复杂度。 No-dt-emb 预测 0/3 CIVO, eval ~32% baseline (类似 Walker/Cartpole)。\n1181\t    若完成, 跨环境 CIVO prevention 总计: Walker 0/4 + Cheetah 0/3 + PickCube 0/1 + Cartpole\n1182\t    0/3 + Hopper 0/3 = 0/14。 但 best 档审稿人已接受 3 环境足够——Hopper 是 bonus。\n1183\t\n1184\t    '\n1185\t  tables:\n1186\t  - name: 'Table: Hopper Hop 3×3 Summary (predicted)'\n1187\t    columns:\n1188\t    - Config\n1189\t    - Eval mean\n1190\t    - NVE>1.5× rate\n1191\t    - Collapse rate\n1192\t    - Baseline%\n1193\t    rows:\n1194\t    - - Baseline\n1195\t      - '222.6'\n1196\t      - 0/3\n1197\t      - 0/3\n1198\t      - 100%\n1199\t    - - CIVO trigger\n1200\t      - '66.9'\n1201\t      - 3/3\n1202\t      - 2/3\n1203\t      - 30.1%\n1204\t    - - No dt_emb\n1205\t      - '71.6'\n1206\t      - 0/3\n1207\t      - 0/3\n1208\t      - 32.2%\n1209\t  figures_description:\n1210\t  - 'Cross-environment summary: 4-5 environments × 3 configs heat map'\n1211\t  analysis: 'P2 但若完成则为论文最强 generalization evidence。\n1212\t\n1213\t    '\n1214\t- name: Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\n1215\t  plan_id: plan_060\n1216\t  description: 'P1 探索性实验: RSSM 预测不确定性超过阈值时截断 imagination rollout。 Walker Walk, dt=2,\n1217\t    1 seed。全部为预测数据。\n1218\t\n1219\t    '\n1220\t  expected_results:\n1221\t    eval_105K_predicted: 485.3\n1222\t    nve_peak_predicted: 1.42\n1223\t    nve_105K_predicted: 0.73\n1224\t    collapse_predicted: false\n1225\t    civo_prevented_predicted: true\n1226\t    vs_baseline_predicted: 53.0%\n1227\t    effective_horizon_mean_predicted: 9.2\n1228\t    effective_horizon_std_predicted: 3.4\n1229\t    truncation_trigger_rate_predicted: 38% of rollout steps\n1230\t    value_calibration_predicted: moderate underestimation (NVE 0.6-0.8×)\n1231\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, uncertainty-gated truncation 是 Intervention Hierarchy\n1232\t    的潜在第四层 (Model-based gating)。预测它部分有效: NVE 保持 <1.5× (CIVO technically prevented),\n1233\t    但 eval 仅 53% baseline (truncation 过于激进, 缩短了有效 imagination horizon)。 这类似于 TCN 的困境:\n1234\t    足以阻止 CIVO 的干预强度也损害了学习。 Truncation rate 38% 表明 RSSM 在相当多的 rollout steps 上不确定——这本身\n1235\t    就是 RSSM fidelity gap 的直接度量。 审稿人可能将此视为 \"interesting pilot but needs more investigation\"——P1\n1236\t    定位合理, 不会升级为论文核心贡献, 但为 future work 提供了具体方向。 如果添加到 Intervention Hierarchy: L4 (Model-based):\n1237\t    Uncertainty truncation 1/1 prevents CIVO but 53% eval retention. 与 L3 TCN (2/8,\n1238\t    45-91% retention) 互补: 不同机制, 类似 trade-off。\n1239\t\n1240\t    '\n1241\t  tables:\n1242\t  - name: 'Table: Uncertainty-Gated Truncation Pilot'\n1243\t    columns:\n1244\t    - Metric\n1245\t    - Value\n1246\t    - Comparison\n1247\t    rows:\n1248\t    - - Eval@105K\n1249\t      - '485.3'\n1250\t      - 53% baseline (vs TCN σ=0.2 68%)\n1251\t    - - NVE_peak\n1252\t      - '1.42'\n1253\t      - Below 1.5× threshold\n1254\t    - - Mean effective horizon\n1255\t      - 9.2/15\n1256\t      - Truncation reduces useful imagination\n1257\t    - - Truncation trigger rate\n1258\t      - 38%\n1259\t      - RSSM uncertain at 38% of steps\n1260\t  figures_description:\n1261\t  - Effective horizon over training + NVE trajectory, showing truncation → NVE suppression\n1262\t  analysis: 'Pilot 结果支持 \"CIVO prevention ↔ learning quality trade-off\" 的系统性发现。 可选添加到\n1263\t    Intervention Hierarchy 作为 L4, 但非论文核心。\n1264\t\n1265\t    '\n1266\t- name: 'Aggregate: Intervention Hierarchy Final Table'\n1267\t  plan_id: aggregate_intervention_hierarchy\n1268\t  description: '论文核心 Table: 所有干预方法的系统性评估汇总。整合 C7 + C8 全部数据。\n1269\t\n1270\t    '\n1271\t  expected_results:\n1272\t    total_seeds_tested: 42\n1273\t    total_methods: 8\n1274\t    total_levels: 3\n1275\t    total_environments: 3\n1276\t    overall_CIVO_prevention_rate: 4/36 (11.1%) — excluding embedding removal control\n1277\t    embedding_removal_rate: 8/8 (100%) — removes the feature entirely\n1278\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, Intervention Hierarchy 被认可为系统性贡献。审稿人看到的是: 8 种方法, 3 个干预层级,\n1279\t    3 个环境, 42 seeds——这是该类问题的首次系统性评估。 关键 narrative: 论文不是 \"我们试了一个方法失败了\", 而是 \"我们系统性地探索了\n1280\t    整个干预空间, 发现 CIVO fundamentally hard to mitigate through post-hoc interventions\"。\n1281\t    Gradient level (L1) 失败因为 forward-pass damage 不可逆; Output level (L2) 失败因为 EMA anchor\n1282\t    被污染; Representation level (L3) 在最优条件下偶尔成功但不可靠。 唯一 100% 有效的方法是移除 feature 本身——这不是\n1283\t    intervention, 是 surrender。 这为 future work 提供了明确方向: 需要 architectural solutions\n1284\t    (THICK/Hieros 式分层时间抽象), 而非 post-hoc patches。\n1285\t\n1286\t    '\n1287\t  tables:\n1288\t  - name: 'Table (论文核心): Intervention Hierarchy'\n1289\t    columns:\n1290\t    - Level\n1291\t    - Method\n1292\t    - Success rate\n1293\t    - Best eval retention\n1294\t    - Primary failure mechanism\n1295\t    rows:\n1296\t    - - L1 Gradient\n1297\t      - Full SGS\n1298\t      - 0/3\n1299\t      - 49%\n1300\t      - Forward-pass damage irreducible\n1301\t    - - L1 Gradient\n1302\t      - Obs-decoder SGS\n1303\t      - 1/6\n1304\t      - 79% (but critic destroyed)\n1305\t      - Compensatory amplification\n1306\t    - - L1 Gradient\n1307\t      - Reward SGS\n1308\t      - 0/2\n1309\t      - 36%\n1310\t      - No-op (gradient ≠ causality)\n1311\t    - - L2 Output\n1312\t      - RAVE ceil=2.0\n1313\t      - 0/1\n1314\t      - 3%\n1315\t      - EMA anchor pollution\n1316\t    - - L2 Output\n1317\t      - RAVE ceil=1.5\n1318\t      - 0/1\n1319\t      - 8%\n1320\t      - EMA anchor pollution\n1321\t    - - L3 Representation\n1322\t      - TCN σ=0.2\n1323\t      - 2/8*\n1324\t      - 91%/45% (high variance)\n1325\t      - Dose insufficient in complex envs\n1326\t    - - L3 Representation\n1327\t      - TCN σ=0.5\n1328\t      - 0/3\n1329\t      - 40%\n1330\t      - Overdose (Walker) / Underdose (Cheetah)\n1331\t    - - L3 Representation\n1332\t      - TCN σ=1.0\n1333\t      - 1/1†\n1334\t      - 27%\n1335\t      - Learning destroyed by noise\n1336\t    - - '**Control**'\n1337\t      - '**dt_emb removal**'\n1338\t      - '**8/8**'\n1339\t      - '**15-37%**'\n1340\t      - '**(removes feature)**'\n1341\t  figures_description:\n1342\t  - 'Figure: Intervention Hierarchy pyramid visualization with success rates'\n1343\t  - '* 2/8 includes Walker-only σ=0.2 success; cross-env 0/4'\n1344\t  - '† Cheetah σ=1.0: technically prevents CIVO (NVE<0.21) but eval 27% → noise destroys\n1345\t    learning'\n1346\t  analysis: '论文最重要的 contribution table。Best 档审稿人将此视为 \"systematic negative results\n1347\t    that save the community significant wasted effort\"。\n1348\t\n1349\t    '\n1350\t- name: 'Aggregate: NVE Cross-Environment Classification'\n1351\t  plan_id: aggregate_nve_classification\n1352\t  description: 'NVE≥1.5× 诊断标记跨环境汇总。\n1353\t\n1354\t    '\n1355\t  expected_results:\n1356\t    walker_trained_above_1.5x: 5/5 (008d s0-s4)\n1357\t    walker_untrained_above_1.5x: 0/7 (008f s0-s4 + 008a s0-s2)\n1358\t    cheetah_trained_above_1.5x: 3/3 (010b s0-s1 + predicted s2)\n1359\t    cheetah_untrained_above_1.5x: 0/5 (024b s0-s1 + 008a_cheetah s0-s1 + predicted)\n1360\t    pickcube_trained_above_1.5x: 1/1 (019b)\n1361\t    pickcube_untrained_above_1.5x: 0/0 (no control run)\n1362\t    total_AUROC: 0.969\n1363\t    total_sensitivity: 0.93\n1364\t    total_specificity: 0.97\n1365\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, NVE 跨环境分类汇总是论文 C2 的 capstone evidence。 Trained dt_emb\n1366\t    → NVE>1.5× 在 9/9+ 个 independent observations 中成立 (部分 seeds 共享 seed number, 需去重)。Untrained\n1367\t    → 0/12+ 超过 1.5×。 AUROC 0.969 在 4 环境 29 data points 上成立, 尽管是 in-sample。 审稿人接受 NVE≥1.5×\n1368\t    作为 \"reliable early-warning diagnostic for CIVO risk in temporal-abstraction world-model\n1369\t    RL\", 建议 held-out validation 作为 future work。\n1370\t\n1371\t    '\n1372\t  tables:\n1373\t  - name: 'Table: NVE Cross-Environment Summary'\n1374\t    columns:\n1375\t    - Environment\n1376\t    - Trained dt_emb NVE>1.5×\n1377\t    - Untrained NVE>1.5×\n1378\t    - Max NVE (trained)\n1379\t    rows:\n1380\t    - - Walker Walk\n1381\t      - 5/5\n1382\t      - 0/7\n1383\t      - 4.12×\n1384\t    - - Cheetah Run\n1385\t      - 3/3\n1386\t      - 0/5\n1387\t      - 70.64×\n1388\t    - - PickCube\n1389\t      - 1/1\n1390\t      - —\n1391\t      - 3.78×\n1392\t    - - '**Total**'\n1393\t      - '**9/9**'\n1394\t      - '**0/12**'\n1395\t      - —\n1396\t  figures_description:\n1397\t  - 'Box plot: NVE distributions by condition (trained vs untrained) across environments'\n1398\t  analysis: NVE 诊断方法的 cross-environment robustness confirmation。\n1399\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c17d4e9b-d260-4cdf-87d4-b48964bed707","uuid":"c35d0c69-25b0-4992-bffc-68ebd31c8f5f","timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:39:23.267Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_9/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T210241/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。论文以 \"Diagnostic Analysis of Value Overestimation\n  from Temporal Abstraction in DreamerV3\" 被接受为高质量诊断论文。三重贡献被认可： (1) CIVO 因果链 (trained\n  dt_emb → RSSM fidelity gap → value overestimation → actor exploitation) 配合 NVE≥1.5×\n  诊断标记 (AUROC 0.969)； (2) MPC vs imagination 架构边界 — TAWM 在 MPC 成功但 dt-conditioning\n  在 imagination-based AC 失败，定位 critic bootstrapping 为特定脆弱点（genuinely novel）； (3) Intervention\n  Hierarchy — 17 seeds × 7 methods × 3 levels 系统性评估，证明 CIVO 在 gradient/output/representation\n  三层均难可靠缓解（首次系统性评估）。 梯度大小 ≠ 因果重要性（reward 38-49% 梯度但 reward-only SGS 失败最惨；obs-decoder\n  16-22% 但因果关键）被视为超越本文的可迁移方法论洞察。 Countermeasures 讨论成功 preempt R9（Double Q 需重构 255-bin\n  categorical critic；MBPO truncation 无法解决 single-step reward bias；ensemble critics\n  定位为最有前景 future work）。 NVE 诊断 AUROC=0.969 配合 Youden-optimal 独立收敛至 1.53× 的说明，化解 in-sample\n  质疑。 Pixel obs 定位为明确 limitation + future work，proprioceptive 设定为 controlled baseline。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: '复现 CIVO collapse 的多 seed 验证。008d 配置 (dt=2, subsample ON, trained dt_emb,\n    H=8)。 Registry 已完成: 009e (s1) + 009b (s2)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_105K: 131.08\n    seed1_nve_peak: 4.12\n    seed1_nve_peak_step: 55000\n    seed1_collapse: true\n    seed1_collapse_type: classic_CIVO_value_driven\n    seed2_eval_105K: 267.93\n    seed2_nve_peak: 2.05\n    seed2_nve_peak_step: 25000\n    seed2_collapse: false\n    seed2_self_correction: true\n    seed2_nve_final: 0.38\n    cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x: 2/2\n    cross_seed_collapse_rate: 1/2\n    independent_collapse_rate: 1/2 (008d s0 与 009e s1 共享 seed=1, 视为同一观测)\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, 2/2 trained dt_emb seeds 均超过 NVE 1.5× 被接受为 CIVO 诊断标记的\n    强 supporting evidence。审稿人理解 collapse 是 stochastic 的——关键发现不是 \"必然崩溃\" 而是 \"trained\n    dt_emb 可靠触发病态过估值 (NVE>1.5×)\"。 Seed 1 的经典 CIVO (value-driven, entropy ↓, NVE 1.78→2.09→4.12\n    加速) vs Seed 2 的自我修正 (NVE 2.05→1.62→0.38 衰减) 被视为丰富了 CIVO 动态的理解， 而非削弱了 claim。Sustained\n    vs transient NVE>1.5× 的差异性（seed 1 连续3个 checkpoint 维持>1.5× → 不可逆; seed 2 仅一次突破\n    → 自我修正）与 Henderson et al. 2018 的早期随机性影响结论一致。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Walker 008d Cross-Seed Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - Eval@105K\n    - NVE_peak\n    - NVE_peak_step\n    - Collapse?\n    - Pattern\n    rows:\n    - - s0 (008d)\n      - '82.75'\n      - '4.12'\n      - 55K\n      - 'Yes'\n      - Value-driven, entropy ↓\n    - - s1 (009e)\n      - '131.08'\n      - '4.12'\n      - 55K\n      - 'Yes'\n      - Same seed as s0, deterministic replication\n    - - s2 (009b)\n      - '267.93'\n      - '2.05'\n      - 25K\n      - 'No'\n      - Transient NVE → self-correction\n  figures_description:\n  - Learning curves (eval + NVE) for 008d s0/s1/s2 overlaid, showing divergence point\n    at ~35K\n  analysis: 'C2 核心证据：trained dt_emb 可靠触发 NVE>1.5× (2/2 independent seeds)。 Collapse\n    是 stochastic (1/2)，但 diagnostic marker 是 deterministic。 Best 档审稿人接受这一区分，不要求 deterministic\n    collapse。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: 'C2 因果控制的多 seed 验证。008f 配置 (dt=2, subsample ON, dt_embed_dim=0, H=8)。\n    Registry: 009f (s1) killed → 使用替代 seeds (008f_s3, 008f_s4); 009c (s2) done。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    seed2_eval_105K: 148.34\n    seed2_nve_peak: 1.26\n    seed2_nve_105K: 1.14\n    seed2_collapse: false\n    seed3_eval_105K: 363.8\n    seed3_nve_peak: <1.5x\n    seed3_collapse: false\n    seed4_eval_105K: 306.5\n    seed4_nve_peak: 1.41\n    seed4_nve_105K: 0.58\n    seed4_collapse: false\n    cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x: 0/3\n    reward_MAE_baseline_ratio: ~75x\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, 0/3 seeds 超过 NVE 1.5× 被接受为 dt_embedding 因果控制的决定性证据。\n    与 008d 的 2/2 形成 5/5 完美分离（trained 2/2 exceed, untrained 0/3 never exceed）。 审稿人注意到\n    009c 的 NVE=1.14@105K 接近但未达 1.5× threshold，且 008f_s4 的 transient NVE=1.41@85K 也在\n    threshold 以下——threshold 的区分力成立。 008f reward_MAE=0.747（baseline 75×）是已知 trade-off:\n    去掉 dt_embedding 后 reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2。审稿人接受这不削弱因果结论——因果控制实验证明的是 \"去掉 X →\n    无崩溃\"，不需要 reward 预测同样好。R8 被 preempt。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 008f Causal Control Cross-Seed'\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - Eval@105K\n    - NVE_peak\n    - NVE@105K\n    - CIVO?\n    rows:\n    - - s0 (008f)\n      - '503'\n      - '1.02'\n      - '0.30'\n      - 'No'\n    - - s2 (009c)\n      - '148.34'\n      - '1.26'\n      - '1.14'\n      - 'No'\n    - - s3\n      - '363.8'\n      - <1.5\n      - —\n      - 'No'\n    - - s4\n      - '306.5'\n      - '1.41'\n      - '0.58'\n      - 'No'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'NVE trajectories: 008d seeds (red, above 1.5× line) vs 008f seeds (blue, below\n    1.5× line)'\n  analysis: '与 008d 2/2 对比，形成 trained vs untrained dt_emb 的完美二分类。 Best 档审稿人视 008f\n    为 \"definitive causal control\"，008f 的低 eval 被理解为 因果控制实验的预期代价。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_013\n  description: 'C3 value growth suppression 多 seed 验证。008a 配置 (dt=2, subsample OFF,\n    trained dt_emb unexposed to dt>1 data, H=15)。Registry 已完成: 008a_unexposed_s1,\n    s2。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_105K: 630.91\n    seed1_ve_ratio_105K: 0.43\n    seed1_civo_alert: 0\n    seed1_delta_ve: -0.0028\n    seed2_eval_105K: 899.4\n    seed2_ve_ratio_105K: 0.333\n    seed2_civo_alert: 0\n    seed2_delta_ve: -0.003\n    cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x: 0/2\n    cross_seed_eval_mean: 765.2\n    cross_seed_eval_range: 631-899\n    vs_baseline_mean: 83.5%\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, unexposed dt_emb（trained 但训练数据中无 dt>1 transition）的两个新\n    seed 均展现 value suppression + 无 CIVO。Seed 2 特别强 (899.4 = 98% baseline)。 Cross-seed\n    均值 765 (83.5% baseline) 显著优于 008f (均值 ~330, 36% baseline)。 审稿人将此解读为: 真正有害的不是 dt_embedding\n    本身的存在，而是当 training data 中含有 dt>1 transitions 时 dt_embedding 学到 dt-specific representations。\n    这强化了 C2 的机制性解释（RSSM fidelity gap + learned conditioning amplification）， 而非简单的\n    \"有 dt_emb = 坏\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 008a Unexposed Cross-Seed'\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - Eval@105K\n    - VE ratio@105K\n    - NVE@105K\n    - Pattern\n    rows:\n    - - s0 (008a)\n      - '777.66'\n      - '0.386'\n      - '0.59'\n      - Zigzag recovery, 2 V-cycles\n    - - s1\n      - '630.91'\n      - '0.43'\n      - ~0.65\n      - Rising trend\n    - - s2\n      - '899.4'\n      - '0.333'\n      - ~0.51\n      - Strong convergence, near-baseline\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Learning curves: 008a 3 seeds vs baseline band, showing zigzag recovery pattern'\n  analysis: 'C3 核心证据加强。3 seeds 一致展现 value suppression (NVE 0.51-0.65x)。 高 seed variance\n    (631-899) 被理解为 dt>1 数据缺失导致的学习不稳定， 而非方法论缺陷。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 (dt=1 imagination) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_014\n  description: 'C6 dt=1 imagination 效果验证。008e_v3 配置 (trained dt_emb, dt=1 imagination,\n    subsample ON, H=15)。Registry 已完成: s1 (success), s2 (collapsed non-CIVO)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_105K: 869.88\n    seed1_nve_peak: 0.8\n    seed1_ve_ratio_105K: 0.527\n    seed1_collapse: false\n    seed1_gate_dt_1_frac: 1.0\n    seed2_eval_105K: 136.96\n    seed2_nve_peak: 3.78\n    seed2_nve_105K: 3.78\n    seed2_collapse: true\n    seed2_collapse_onset: 95K\n    seed2_actor_entropy_trend: rising (-5.21@85K → -3.83@105K)\n    seed2_gate_dt_1_frac: 1.0\n    cross_seed_collapse_rate: 1/2\n    collapse_mechanism_difference: seed2 = eval-driven (Pathway B), not value-driven\n      (Pathway A)\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, C6 PARTIALLY FALSIFIED 被透明报告并获审稿人认可。dt=1 imagination\n    不能阻止崩溃 (1/2 seeds)，但崩溃机制与经典 CIVO 定性不同： - 008d s0 (Pathway A): value 爆炸 → actor\n    exploit → eval 下跌，entropy ↓ - 008e_v3 s2 (Pathway B): eval 先跌 → NVE 被动升高，entropy\n    ↑ (策略变随机) 审稿人接受 \"trained dt_embedding creates vulnerability through multiple pathways\"\n    这一更深层洞察。009a baseline s2 在同期完全稳定 (618→596→836)，排除 seed 脆弱假说。这实际上丰富了论文贡献——CIVO\n    不是唯一的脆弱通道。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Pathway A vs Pathway B Collapse Dynamics'\n    columns:\n    - Feature\n    - 008d s0 (Pathway A)\n    - 008e_v3 s2 (Pathway B)\n    rows:\n    - - Value change\n      - Explosive (60→138, +130%@55K)\n      - Moderate (339→384→340, +13%→-12%)\n    - - Eval change\n      - Post-value (146→83, -43%)\n      - Leads (715→452→137, -81%)\n    - - NVE driver\n      - Value numerator (value explosion)\n      - Eval denominator (eval crash)\n    - - Actor entropy\n      - ↓ (-3.47→-4.88, policy locks)\n      - ↑ (-5.21→-3.83, policy destabilizes)\n    - - Mechanism\n      - Critic overestimate → actor exploit\n      - Eval crash → value lag\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Dual-axis plot: value + entropy trajectories for Pathway A and B, color-coded'\n  analysis: 'C6 从 \"practical mitigation\" 降级为 \"mechanistic insight: trained dt_emb\n    创建 多条脆弱通道\"。Best 档审稿人视此为 honest reporting + deeper understanding， 而非 weakness。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 imag + H=8\n  plan_id: plan_015\n  description: '诊断 dt_emb TRAINING 是否为 CIVO 必要条件。dt_embedding 保持随机初始化但 freeze (requires_grad=False)。Registry\n    已完成: exp_015b。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    eval_105K: 204.2\n    nve_85K: 0.467\n    nve_95K: 0.394\n    nve_105K: 0.42\n    collapse: false\n    actor_loss_105K: 0.000179\n    actor_entropy_105K: -4.855\n    value_mean_105K: 56.212\n    gate_dt_mean: 2.0\n    collapse_mechanism: gradient_starvation_from_frozen_dt_emb\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, frozen dt_emb 不崩溃但性能很差 (204 = 22% baseline)。NVE 全程 0.39-0.47\n    (远低于 1.0×, critic 严重低估)，actor_loss → 0（梯度饥饿）。这确认了 dt_emb 的 TRAINING 是 CIVO 的必要条件——没有训练的\n    dt_embedding 只是噪声输入， 不会创建 RSSM 对精确 dt 信号的 co-adaptation。但 frozen embedding 引入了\n    新问题（梯度饥饿），证明这不是一个可行的 mitigation 方向。 审稿人将此视为 2×2 消融矩阵 (008a/008d/008f/015b) 的完成：\n    - 008d (trained + subsample ON): CIVO ✓ - 008a (trained + subsample OFF): No CIVO\n    ✓ (unexposed) - 008f (removed, subsample ON): No CIVO ✓ (no embedding) - 015b\n    (frozen + subsample ON): No CIVO ✓ (frozen) 只有 008d (trained AND exposed to dt>1\n    data) 产生 CIVO → training 是必要条件。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: dt_emb 2×2 Ablation Matrix'\n    columns:\n    - Config\n    - dt_emb state\n    - Exposed to dt>1?\n    - CIVO?\n    - Eval@105K\n    - NVE range\n    rows:\n    - - 008d\n      - Trained\n      - Yes (subsample ON)\n      - Yes (2/2)\n      - 82-131\n      - 1.71-4.12\n    - - 008a\n      - Trained\n      - No (subsample OFF)\n      - No (0/3)\n      - 631-899\n      - 0.51-0.65\n    - - 008f\n      - Removed (dim=0)\n      - 'Yes'\n      - No (0/4)\n      - 148-503\n      - 0.30-1.41\n    - - 015b\n      - Frozen (random init)\n      - 'Yes'\n      - No (0/1)\n      - '204'\n      - 0.39-0.47\n  figures_description:\n  - '2×2 grid: eval trajectories for each ablation cell'\n  analysis: '闭合因果推理: dt_emb training + exposure to dt>1 data 两个条件同时满足时才触发 CIVO。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (seed 3-4)\n  plan_id: plan_016\n  description: '缩小 008e_v3 (dt=1 imagination) 崩溃概率估计区间。Registry 已完成: s3 + s4。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    seed3_eval_105K: 92.7\n    seed3_nve_peak: 4.02\n    seed3_collapse: true\n    seed3_collapse_onset: 85K-95K\n    seed3_actor_entropy_final: -4.892\n    seed4_eval_105K: 899.3\n    seed4_nve_peak: 0.99\n    seed4_collapse: false\n    total_008e_v3_collapse_rate: 2/4 (50%)\n    collapse_pathway_breakdown: s2 = Pathway B (eval-driven, entropy ↑); s3 = mixed\n      (entropy remains low)\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, 2/4 崩溃率 (50%) 与 008d 的 1/2 (50%) 完全一致——dt=1 imagination\n    未降低崩溃概率。这是 C6 PARTIALLY FALSIFIED 的最有力量化证据。 s3 崩溃 (NVE 4.02, entropy stays low\n    at -4.892) 引入了第三种可能的动态模式， 但 best 档审稿人不要求对每个 seed 的机制差异做完整解释——4 seeds 确认 50% 崩溃率已经足够。核心结论:\n    trained dt_embedding 是根本脆弱源，dt=1 imagination 只消除了一条特定通道 (Pathway A) 但不消除全部通道。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 008e_v3 Cross-Seed Summary (dt=1 imagination)'\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - Eval@105K\n    - NVE_peak\n    - Collapse?\n    - Pathway\n    rows:\n    - - s1 (008e_v3)\n      - '869.9'\n      - '0.80'\n      - 'No'\n      - Healthy\n    - - s2\n      - '137.0'\n      - '3.78'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - B (eval-driven, entropy ↑)\n    - - s3\n      - '92.7'\n      - '4.02'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - Mixed (entropy stays low)\n    - - s4\n      - '899.3'\n      - '0.99'\n      - 'No'\n      - Healthy\n  figures_description:\n  - 4-seed eval trajectories with collapse markers, showing 50% divergence\n  analysis: '50% collapse rate 确认 dt=1 imagination 非有效 mitigation。Best 档审稿人 视此为诚实报告\n    + 对 trained dt_emb 多通道脆弱性的系统性证据。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_020\n  description: '第二 DMC 环境基准线。Registry 已有 5 seeds (023a/023b/023_s2/s3/s4)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_eval_final: 624.7\n    seed1_eval_final: 520.3\n    seed2_eval_final: 645.4\n    seed3_eval_final: 642.13\n    seed4_eval_final: 537.03\n    cross_seed_mean: 593.9\n    cross_seed_std: 56.8\n    cross_seed_range: 520-645\n    ve_ratio_converged: 0.65-0.70\n    ve_ratio_stable_from: 150K+\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, Cheetah baseline 提供了 NVE 归一化的可靠分母。5 seeds 的一致性 (std=56.8,\n    CV=9.6%) 表明 Cheetah 环境有适度但可接受的 seed variance。 VE ratio 收敛到 0.65-0.70 (类似 Walker\n    的 0.69-0.72)，支持 NVE 归一化方法 在跨环境的适用性。审稿人接受 5 seeds 足够建立可靠 baseline。 s4 的 194K→204K\n    eval 骤降 (537→302) 被确认为 transient fluctuation (延长到 300K 恢复到 642)，不是 instability。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cheetah Baseline Cross-Seed'\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - Eval final\n    - Peak eval\n    - VE ratio converged\n    rows:\n    - - s0\n      - '624.7'\n      - '624.7'\n      - ~0.67\n    - - s1\n      - '520.3'\n      - '572.9'\n      - ~0.65\n    - - s2\n      - '645.4'\n      - '645.4'\n      - ~0.68\n    - - s3\n      - '642.1'\n      - '685.9'\n      - ~0.69\n    - - s4\n      - 537.0 (ext→642)\n      - '642.3'\n      - ~0.66\n  figures_description:\n  - Cheetah baseline 5-seed learning curves with IQM band\n  analysis: 'Robust baseline。Cross-seed IQM ~600，用于所有 Cheetah CIVO 实验的归一化。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_021\n  description: 'Cheetah 环境 CIVO 复现。Registry: 010b (s1 eval 51.7, NVE 8.27) + 010b_s0\n    (eval 0.83, NVE 70.64)。需 seed 2 预测。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_eval_final: 0.83\n    seed0_nve_peak: 70.64\n    seed0_collapse: true\n    seed1_eval_final: 51.7\n    seed1_nve_peak: 8.27\n    seed1_collapse: true\n    seed2_eval_final_predicted: 38.5\n    seed2_nve_peak_predicted: 12.4\n    seed2_nve_peak_step_predicted: 55K\n    seed2_collapse_predicted: true\n    cross_seed_collapse_rate: 3/3\n    cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x: 3/3\n    cheetah_vs_walker_severity: Cheetah NVE peaks 2-9× higher than Walker (8-70× vs\n      2-4×)\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, Cheetah CIVO 比 Walker 更严重但 100% 一致。Cheetah 的 3/3 崩溃率\n    (vs Walker 的 ~50%) 表明环境复杂度放大了 CIVO——更复杂的 dynamics → 更大的 RSSM fidelity gap → 更强的\n    value overestimation feedback loop。 NVE peaks 远高于 Walker (8-70× vs 2-4×) 同样支持这一解读。\n    审稿人将跨环境 NVE severity 差异视为支持 \"CIVO severity scales with RSSM prediction difficulty\"\n    的证据——这不是 noise，而是 signal。 Seed 2 预测基于 s0/s1 的模式: Cheetah 中 CIVO 更可靠 (100% vs Walker\n    50%)， NVE peak 在 8-70× 范围内。保守预测 12.4× 处于该范围中段。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cheetah CIVO Trigger Cross-Seed'\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - Eval final\n    - NVE_peak\n    - Collapse?\n    - Baseline%\n    rows:\n    - - s0\n      - '0.83'\n      - '70.64'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 0.1%\n    - - s1\n      - '51.7'\n      - '8.27'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 8.7%\n    - - s2 (predicted)\n      - '38.5'\n      - '12.4'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 6.5%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cheetah CIVO: NVE trajectories showing extreme overestimation peaks'\n  analysis: 'Cheetah 100% collapse rate 加强了 C1 + C2。与 Walker 的 severity 差异 提供了额外的\n    mechanistic insight。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_022\n  description: 'Cheetah 因果控制。Registry: 024b_s0 (eval 96.5, no CIVO), 024b_s1 (eval\n    77.3). Need seed 2 prediction.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_eval_final: 96.5\n    seed0_nve_peak: 0.2\n    seed0_civo: false\n    seed1_eval_final: 77.3\n    seed1_nve_peak: 0.1\n    seed1_civo: false\n    seed2_eval_final_predicted: 88.2\n    seed2_nve_peak_predicted: 0.15\n    seed2_civo_predicted: false\n    cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x: 0/3\n    cross_seed_eval_mean: 87.3\n    vs_baseline: 14.7%\n    reward_prediction_quality: severely degraded (similar to Walker 008f pattern)\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, Cheetah no-dt-emb 完美复现 Walker 008f 的模式: 0/3 CIVO, 但\n    eval 严重下降 (14.7% baseline)。NVE 全程极低 (<0.2×)，连 baseline 水平的 value 估计都无法达到。这不是好的\n    mitigation (性能损失太大)，但作为因果控制完美: 去掉 dt_embedding → CIVO 消失。 Cheetah 的 dt-emb-removal\n    性能损失 (14.7%) 比 Walker (36%) 更大，这合理—— Cheetah 的更复杂 dynamics 意味着缺失 temporal information\n    的代价更高。 审稿人接受 008f/024b 是因果控制而非推荐方案。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cheetah Causal Control (no dt_emb)'\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - Eval final\n    - NVE_peak\n    - CIVO?\n    - Baseline%\n    rows:\n    - - s0\n      - '96.5'\n      - '0.2'\n      - 'No'\n      - 15.4%\n    - - s1\n      - '77.3'\n      - '0.1'\n      - 'No'\n      - 12.3%\n    - - s2 (predicted)\n      - '88.2'\n      - '0.15'\n      - 'No'\n      - 14.8%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cheetah: CIVO trigger (red) vs no-dt-emb control (blue) eval curves'\n  analysis: '跨环境因果控制复现。dt_embedding removal 的 5/5 (Walker) + 3/3 (Cheetah) = 8/8 CIVO\n    prevention rate。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_023\n  description: 'Cheetah unexposed dt_emb 验证 (C3)。Registry: 008a_cheetah_s0 (532.35,\n    NVE 0.49), s1 (504.38, NVE 0.478). Need seed 2 prediction.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_eval_105K: 532.35\n    seed0_nve_105K: 0.49\n    seed0_civo: false\n    seed1_eval_105K: 504.38\n    seed1_nve_105K: 0.478\n    seed1_civo: false\n    seed2_eval_105K_predicted: 518.6\n    seed2_nve_105K_predicted: 0.48\n    seed2_civo_predicted: false\n    cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x: 0/3\n    cross_seed_eval_mean: 518.4\n    vs_baseline: 87.3%\n    vs_no_dt_emb: 5.9x better (518 vs 87)\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, Cheetah unexposed dt_emb 展现出与 Walker 008a 一致的 pattern:\n    接近 baseline 的性能 (87% vs Walker 83.5%), NVE 全程受抑 (0.48-0.49×), 无 CIVO。这与 no-dt-emb\n    (plan_022, 14.7% baseline) 形成鲜明对比—— 保留 dt_embedding 但不暴露于 dt>1 data 是明显更优的方案。\n    跨环境一致性极高 (Walker 83.5% vs Cheetah 87.3% of baseline)，审稿人将此 视为 C3 在第二环境的强复现。Seed\n    variance 在 Cheetah 很小 (504-532, 2.7%) vs Walker 的较大 variance (631-899, 17.4%)——可能因为\n    Cheetah 的 simpler reward structure 导致更一致的学习。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cheetah Unexposed dt_emb (C3 validation)'\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - Eval@105K\n    - NVE@105K\n    - CIVO?\n    - Baseline%\n    rows:\n    - - s0\n      - '532.4'\n      - '0.49'\n      - 'No'\n      - 89.7%\n    - - s1\n      - '504.4'\n      - '0.48'\n      - 'No'\n      - 84.9%\n    - - s2 (predicted)\n      - '518.6'\n      - '0.48'\n      - 'No'\n      - 87.3%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cross-environment C3 comparison: Walker 008a vs Cheetah unexposed, normalized'\n  analysis: 'C3 跨环境验证完成。Unexposed dt_emb 在两环境均提供 >83% baseline 性能和 NVE<0.5×。\n\n    '\n- name: Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_050\n  description: '非运动型 DMC 环境基准线。DreamerV3 proprioceptive Cartpole Swingup。 全部为预测数据。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_eval_final_predicted: 842.3\n    seed1_eval_final_predicted: 818.6\n    seed2_eval_final_predicted: 854.1\n    cross_seed_mean_predicted: 838.3\n    cross_seed_std_predicted: 18.0\n    convergence_step_predicted: ~80K (faster than Walker ~100K due to simpler dynamics)\n    ve_ratio_converged_predicted: 0.68-0.73\n    eval_peak_range_predicted: 850-870\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, Cartpole Swingup baseline 提供非运动环境的参考点。DreamerV3 在 proprioceptive\n    Cartpole 上通常达到 ~830-860 (基于公开 benchmark)。 收敛更快 (~80K vs Walker ~100K) 因为 observation\n    space 更小 (5D vs 24D) 且 dynamics 更简单。VE ratio 收敛到类似 Walker/Cheetah 的 ~0.70 范围，\n    表明 DreamerV3 的 value calibration 跨环境一致。 低 seed variance (CV ~2.1%) 预期因为 Cartpole\n    的 simpler dynamics 导致 更一致的学习。审稿人接受这作为第三环境 baseline。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cartpole Swingup Baseline (predicted)'\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - Eval final\n    - VE ratio\n    - Convergence step\n    rows:\n    - - s0\n      - '842.3'\n      - '0.71'\n      - ~78K\n    - - s1\n      - '818.6'\n      - '0.69'\n      - ~82K\n    - - s2\n      - '854.1'\n      - '0.73'\n      - ~76K\n  figures_description:\n  - Cartpole baseline learning curves with Walker/Cheetah normalized comparison\n  analysis: '非运动环境 baseline 确立。对 C1/C2/C3 的跨 task-type 验证至关重要。 但 best 档 narrative\n    指出 Walker+Cheetah+PickCube 已足够——Cartpole 是 additional strength, not a requirement。\n\n    '\n- name: Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_051\n  description: '非运动环境 CIVO 复现。全部为预测数据。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_eval_105K_predicted: 127.4\n    seed0_nve_peak_predicted: 3.21\n    seed0_nve_peak_step_predicted: 55K\n    seed0_collapse_predicted: true\n    seed1_eval_105K_predicted: 612.7\n    seed1_nve_peak_predicted: 1.83\n    seed1_nve_peak_step_predicted: 45K\n    seed1_collapse_predicted: false\n    seed1_self_correction_predicted: true\n    seed2_eval_105K_predicted: 95.6\n    seed2_nve_peak_predicted: 4.47\n    seed2_nve_peak_step_predicted: 65K\n    seed2_collapse_predicted: true\n    cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x_predicted: 3/3\n    cross_seed_collapse_rate_predicted: 2/3\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, Cartpole CIVO 表现与 Walker 类似而非 Cheetah。Cartpole 的简单 dynamics\n    意味着 RSSM fidelity gap 中等 (类似 Walker)，所以 CIVO severity 处于 Walker 和 Cheetah 之间。3/3\n    seeds 超过 NVE 1.5× (诊断标记一致), 2/3 collapse (类似 Walker 50% rate)。 Seed 1 自我修正模式与\n    009b (Walker) 一致——transient NVE>1.5× 后衰减。 这跨环境复现了 \"sustained vs transient NVE\"\n    的 stochastic divergence 模式。 审稿人将此视为 CIVO 机制跨 task type 的强验证——不仅限于 locomotion。\n    NVE peaks (1.83-4.47) 处于 Walker (2.05-4.12) 类似范围，而非 Cheetah 的 极端范围 (8-70×)，支持\n    \"CIVO severity ~ RSSM difficulty\" 假设。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cartpole CIVO Trigger (predicted)'\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - Eval@105K\n    - NVE_peak\n    - Collapse?\n    - Pattern\n    rows:\n    - - s0\n      - '127.4'\n      - '3.21'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - Classic CIVO\n    - - s1\n      - '612.7'\n      - '1.83'\n      - 'No'\n      - Transient → self-correction\n    - - s2\n      - '95.6'\n      - '4.47'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - Classic CIVO\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cross-environment NVE peak comparison: Walker / Cheetah / Cartpole'\n  analysis: '非运动环境 CIVO 确认。3/3 NVE>1.5× + 2/3 collapse, 与 locomotion 一致。\n\n    '\n- name: Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_052\n  description: '非运动环境因果控制。全部为预测数据。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_eval_105K_predicted: 312.4\n    seed0_nve_peak_predicted: 0.35\n    seed0_civo_predicted: false\n    seed1_eval_105K_predicted: 278.9\n    seed1_nve_peak_predicted: 0.42\n    seed1_civo_predicted: false\n    seed2_eval_105K_predicted: 335.1\n    seed2_nve_peak_predicted: 0.28\n    seed2_civo_predicted: false\n    cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x_predicted: 0/3\n    cross_seed_eval_mean_predicted: 308.8\n    vs_baseline_predicted: 36.8%\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, Cartpole no-dt-emb 复现 Walker/Cheetah 的因果控制模式: 0/3 CIVO,\n    eval 显著低于 baseline (36.8%)。 Cartpole 的 eval loss (63.2%) 介于 Walker (64%) 和 Cheetah\n    (85.3%) 之间， 与环境复杂度的排序一致 (Cheetah > Cartpole > Walker in temporal info value)。\n    但这可能存在混淆 (Cartpole 的 temporal info 可能天然不如 locomotion 重要)， best 档审稿人不深究此点——关键是\n    CIVO prevention = 100%。 跨三环境汇总: dt_emb removal → 0/11 CIVO (Walker 0/4 + Cheetah\n    0/3 + Cartpole 0/3 + PickCube 0/1)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cartpole Causal Control (predicted)'\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - Eval@105K\n    - NVE_peak\n    - CIVO?\n    - Baseline%\n    rows:\n    - - s0\n      - '312.4'\n      - '0.35'\n      - 'No'\n      - 37.1%\n    - - s1\n      - '278.9'\n      - '0.42'\n      - 'No'\n      - 33.1%\n    - - s2\n      - '335.1'\n      - '0.28'\n      - 'No'\n      - 39.9%\n  figures_description:\n  - Cross-environment causal control summary bar chart\n  analysis: '第三环境因果控制完成。dt_emb removal → 0/11 CIVO prevention 跨所有环境。\n\n    '\n- name: 'RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions'\n  plan_id: plan_030\n  description: 'RSSM fidelity gap 量化。Registry 已完成: exp_rssm_fidelity_analysis。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    baseline_dt1_obs_MSE: 13.49\n    baseline_dt2_obs_MSE: 27.5\n    baseline_obs_gap: 2.04\n    baseline_dt1_reward_MAE: 0.0102\n    baseline_dt2_reward_MAE: 0.0159\n    baseline_reward_gap: 1.56\n    008d_dt1_obs_MSE: 41.31\n    008d_dt2_obs_MSE: 53.67\n    008d_obs_gap: 1.3\n    008d_dt1_reward_MAE: 0.0568\n    008d_dt2_reward_MAE: 0.1579\n    008d_reward_gap: 2.78\n    008f_dt1_obs_MSE: 8.01\n    008f_dt2_obs_MSE: 22.04\n    008f_obs_gap: 2.75\n    008f_dt1_reward_MAE: 0.7469\n    008f_dt2_reward_MAE: 0.7526\n    008f_reward_gap: 1.01\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, RSSM fidelity 表是 C2 机制解释的核心定量支撑。关键 insight: (1) 008d\n    obs_gap 仅 1.30× (看似小), 但 dt1 绝对误差 41.31 已是 baseline 的 3× → 模型本身已崩塌，低 gap ratio\n    是误导性的。论文必须并排呈现绝对值和比率。 (2) 008d reward_gap 2.78× → trained dt_emb 让 reward head\n    学到了精确的 dt-specific reward predictions, 但这个精确度建立在 RSSM 的 imprecise states 上 → 系统性\n    reward 过估。 (3) 008f reward_gap 1.01× → no dt_emb 时 reward head 完全无法区分 dt=1/dt=2,\n    reward_MAE=0.747 (baseline 75×), 这是 \"去掉 dt_emb 代价太大\" 的定量证据。 审稿人视此表为 \"smoking gun\"——不是模型不好，而是\n    conditioning 让模型在错误的 基础上过于 confident。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1 (论文): RSSM Fidelity Analysis'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - dt1 obs_MSE\n    - dt2 obs_MSE\n    - obs gap\n    - dt1 rew_MAE\n    - dt2 rew_MAE\n    - rew gap\n    rows:\n    - - Baseline (dt=1)\n      - '13.49'\n      - '27.50'\n      - 2.04×\n      - '0.010'\n      - '0.016'\n      - 1.56×\n    - - 008d (trained dt_emb)\n      - '41.31'\n      - '53.67'\n      - 1.30×*\n      - '0.057'\n      - '0.158'\n      - 2.78×\n    - - 008f (no dt_emb)\n      - '8.01'\n      - '22.04'\n      - 2.75×\n      - '0.747'\n      - '0.753'\n      - 1.01×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: absolute errors (grouped by model) + ratio annotations'\n  - '* 008d low obs gap ratio is misleading — absolute errors are 3× baseline'\n  analysis: 'Figure 4 / Table 1 核心证据。三模型对比完整揭示 trained dt_emb 如何创建 CIVO 的 forward-pass\n    基础。\n\n    '\n- name: Actor entropy analysis\n  plan_id: plan_031\n  description: '从现有 metrics.jsonl 提取 actor_entropy trajectories。0 GPU cost。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    008d_s0_entropy_35K: -3.465\n    008d_s0_entropy_45K: -4.575\n    008d_s0_entropy_55K: -4.879\n    008d_s0_trend: monotonic decrease → policy locks onto overestimated actions\n    008e_v3_s2_entropy_85K: -5.208\n    008e_v3_s2_entropy_95K: -4.529\n    008e_v3_s2_entropy_105K: -3.828\n    008e_v3_s2_trend: increase during collapse → policy destabilizes\n    008a_s0_entropy_105K_predicted: -5.1\n    008a_s0_trend: stable convergence to low entropy (normal learning)\n    baseline_entropy_converged_predicted: -5.2 to -5.5\n    016e_entropy_comparison: SGS preserves ~1.0-1.3 nats higher entropy through 35-55K\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, actor entropy 分析提供了 Pathway A vs B 的独立定量区分。 Pathway\n    A (008d s0): entropy 单调下降 (-3.47 → -4.88) = actor 变得越来越 deterministic，exploit\n    overestimated value regions。这是经典 CIVO 签名。 Pathway B (008e_v3 s2): entropy 上升 (-5.21\n    → -3.83) = policy 在崩溃期间 变随机，失去已学结构。这与 value-driven exploitation 相反。 健康配置 (008a,\n    baseline): entropy 稳定收敛到 ~-5.2 (正常确定性策略)。 SGS (016e) 的高 entropy (+1.0-1.3 nats)\n    解释了它为何延迟但不阻止 CIVO: 更多探索暂时抵消了 value overestimation, 但无法永久阻止。 审稿人视此为 Figure 级别的\n    supporting evidence, 加强了论文的机制性叙事。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Actor Entropy Signatures'\n    columns:\n    - Config\n    - Entropy@35K\n    - Entropy@55K\n    - Entropy@105K\n    - Trend\n    - Classification\n    rows:\n    - - Baseline s0\n      - '-4.2'\n      - '-5.0'\n      - '-5.3'\n      - Converging ↓\n      - Healthy\n    - - 008a s0 (unexposed)\n      - '-3.8'\n      - '-4.6'\n      - '-5.1'\n      - Converging ↓\n      - Healthy\n    - - 008d s0 (CIVO)\n      - '-3.47'\n      - '-4.88'\n      - —(collapsed)\n      - Accelerating ↓\n      - Pathway A\n    - - 008e_v3 s2\n      - '-5.12'\n      - '-5.12'\n      - '-3.83'\n      - Rising ↑ at collapse\n      - Pathway B\n    - - 016e (SGS)\n      - '-2.12'\n      - '-3.62'\n      - —(collapsed)\n      - Delayed ↓\n      - SGS-modified CIVO\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Entropy trajectories — healthy (blue) vs Pathway A (red) vs Pathway B\n    (orange)'\n  analysis: 'Entropy 分析提供了 collapse 动态的独立验证维度。Best 档审稿人将此 视为 mechanism-level claim\n    的有力 supplementary evidence。\n\n    '\n- name: Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\n  plan_id: plan_032\n  description: 'V(s) vs Monte Carlo return 分布对比。1 GPU hour for trajectory collection。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    baseline_v_mc_correlation_predicted: 0.92\n    baseline_v_mc_bias_predicted: +2-5% (slight optimism, normal)\n    008d_v_mc_correlation_35K_predicted: 0.71\n    008d_v_mc_correlation_55K_predicted: 0.38\n    008d_v_mc_bias_55K_predicted: +180% (extreme optimism at dt>1 states)\n    008d_dt2_specific_bias_predicted: +250% at dt=2 imagined states vs +40% at dt=1\n    008a_v_mc_correlation_predicted: 0.85\n    008a_v_mc_bias_predicted: -5% (slight pessimism, consistent with NVE<1.0×)\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, distributional analysis 升级了 v/e ratio proxy 的说服力。 关键发现:\n    008d 的 value overestimation 不是 uniform 的——它集中在 dt>1 imagined states (+250%), 而\n    dt=1 states 仅有 +40% 偏差。这直接证明了 trained dt_embedding + RSSM fidelity gap 的交互效应。\n    008a 的轻微 pessimism (-5%) 与 NVE<1.0× 一致，说明 unexposed dt_emb 实际上倾向于 underestimate\n    value (safe bias)。 审稿人视此为 \"beyond a crude proxy\" (preempt R3) 的关键补充分析。 如果时间不足,\n    best 档 narrative 中 v/e ratio proxy 仍被接受 (R3 被 preempt by the 4/4 NVE threshold\n    + AUROC analysis)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: V(s) vs MC Return Statistics'\n    columns:\n    - Config\n    - V-MC correlation\n    - Mean bias\n    - dt>1 specific bias\n    rows:\n    - - Baseline\n      - '0.92'\n      - +3%\n      - N/A (dt=1 only)\n    - - 008d@35K\n      - '0.71'\n      - +85%\n      - +160% at dt=2\n    - - 008d@55K\n      - '0.38'\n      - +180%\n      - +250% at dt=2\n    - - 008a@105K\n      - '0.85'\n      - -5%\n      - N/A (unexposed)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter plots: V(s) vs MC return, color-coded by dt, with regression lines'\n  analysis: 'P2 优先级, 但若完成则显著加强 C2 的 mechanistic depth。\n\n    '\n- name: dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\n  plan_id: plan_033\n  description: '跟踪 dt=1 和 dt=2 embedding vectors 在训练过程中的分离。0 GPU cost。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    initial_cosine_sim_predicted: 0.02\n    cosine_sim_15K_predicted: -0.12\n    cosine_sim_35K_predicted: -0.38\n    cosine_sim_55K_predicted: -0.52\n    cosine_sim_105K_predicted: -0.61\n    embedding_norm_ratio_dt2_vs_dt1_predicted: 1.34\n    divergence_onset_predicted: 10-15K (coincides with reward head learning dt-specific\n      predictions)\n    frozen_cosine_sim_predicted: 0.02\n    008f_predicted: N/A (dt_embed_dim=0)\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, embedding cosine similarity 提供了 trained dt_emb 如何 diverge\n    的 可视化证据。dt=1 和 dt=2 embeddings 从近似随机 (cos~0) 分化到显著负相关 (cos~-0.5 to -0.6)。分化 onset\n    (~15K) 与 reward head 开始区分 dt=1/dt=2 的时间一致 (RSSM fidelity 表中 008d reward_gap 从\n    15K 开始明显 > 1.0)。 Embedding norm ratio >1 表明 dt=2 embedding 的幅度更大——可能因为 RSSM 需要更强的\n    conditioning signal 来处理较大的 temporal gap。 审稿人视此为 minor supplementary analysis。不会改变论文的核心评估，\n    但为 appendix/supplementary 提供了有用的可视化。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: dt_embedding Cosine Similarity Evolution'\n    columns:\n    - Step\n    - cos(emb_dt1, emb_dt2)\n    - '||emb_dt2|| / ||emb_dt1||'\n    rows:\n    - - 0 (init)\n      - '0.02'\n      - '1.00'\n    - - 15K\n      - '-0.12'\n      - '1.08'\n    - - 35K\n      - '-0.38'\n      - '1.21'\n    - - 55K\n      - '-0.52'\n      - '1.30'\n    - - 105K\n      - '-0.61'\n      - '1.34'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: cosine similarity over training steps, annotated with CIVO onset'\n  analysis: 'P2 supplementary analysis。Embedding divergence 与 CIVO onset 的时间相关性 提供了额外的\n    mechanistic link。\n\n    '\n- name: NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\n  plan_id: plan_034\n  description: '从所有已完成实验计算 NVE 分类性能。0 GPU cost。AUROC + Youden-optimal threshold。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_data_points: 29\n    environments: 4\n    AUROC: 0.969\n    threshold_sweep:\n      t1.0:\n        sensitivity: 1.0\n        specificity: 0.72\n        accuracy: 0.83\n        youden_J: 0.72\n      t1.2:\n        sensitivity: 0.96\n        specificity: 0.86\n        accuracy: 0.9\n        youden_J: 0.82\n      t1.3:\n        sensitivity: 0.93\n        specificity: 0.93\n        accuracy: 0.93\n        youden_J: 0.86\n      t1.5:\n        sensitivity: 0.93\n        specificity: 0.97\n        accuracy: 0.95\n        youden_J: 0.9\n      t1.7:\n        sensitivity: 0.86\n        specificity: 1.0\n        accuracy: 0.93\n        youden_J: 0.86\n      t2.0:\n        sensitivity: 0.75\n        specificity: 1.0\n        accuracy: 0.88\n        youden_J: 0.75\n    youden_optimal_threshold: 1.53\n    youden_optimal_J: 0.905\n    classification_at_1.5x:\n      true_positives: 13\n      true_negatives: 14\n      false_positives: 1\n      false_negatives: 1\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, AUROC=0.969 配合 Youden-optimal 独立收敛到 1.53× 化解了 in-sample\n    calibration 质疑 (R10)。审稿人认可: (1) Youden-optimal 1.53× 与预设 1.5× 的独立收敛不是 overfitting——如果\n    threshold 是 post-hoc 选择, Youden optimal 不太可能恰好落在同一位置。 (2) 4 环境 × 多 config 提供了\n    reasonable diversity, 尽管仍是 in-sample。 (3) 1-2 个 borderline cases (false positive/negative)\n    的存在反而增加可信度—— perfect 分类在小样本下更像 overfitting。 审稿人建议 held-out validation 作为 future\n    work, 但不作为 major weakness。 NVE 在不同 reward scale 下的 generalization boundary 被明确讨论\n    (Cheetah NVE peaks 远高于 Walker, 但 threshold 仍有效分类)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: NVE Threshold Sensitivity (AUROC=0.969)'\n    columns:\n    - Threshold\n    - Sensitivity\n    - Specificity\n    - Accuracy\n    - Youden J\n    rows:\n    - - 1.0×\n      - '1.00'\n      - '0.72'\n      - '0.83'\n      - '0.72'\n    - - 1.2×\n      - '0.96'\n      - '0.86'\n      - '0.90'\n      - '0.82'\n    - - 1.3×\n      - '0.93'\n      - '0.93'\n      - '0.93'\n      - '0.86'\n    - - '**1.5×**'\n      - '**0.93**'\n      - '**0.97**'\n      - '**0.95**'\n      - '**0.90**'\n    - - 1.7×\n      - '0.86'\n      - '1.00'\n      - '0.93'\n      - '0.86'\n    - - 2.0×\n      - '0.75'\n      - '1.00'\n      - '0.88'\n      - '0.75'\n  - name: 'Table: Youden-Optimal Analysis'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Value\n    rows:\n    - - AUROC\n      - '0.969'\n    - - Youden-optimal threshold\n      - 1.53×\n    - - Preselected threshold\n      - 1.50×\n    - - Convergence gap\n      - 0.03× (2%)\n    - - N data points\n      - '29'\n    - - N environments\n      - '4'\n  figures_description:\n  - ROC curve with AUROC annotation and Youden-optimal point marked\n  - Threshold vs accuracy/sensitivity/specificity trade-off curves\n  analysis: 'NVE 诊断的定量基础。AUROC 0.969 + Youden 独立收敛是论文最强的方法论贡献之一。 Best 档审稿人接受 with\n    caveat (in-sample), 不降级为 major weakness。\n\n    '\n- name: Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\n  plan_id: plan_040\n  description: '第三 locomotion 环境。P2 优先级。全部为预测数据。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    baseline:\n      seed0_eval_final_predicted: 232.4\n      seed1_eval_final_predicted: 178.6\n      seed2_eval_final_predicted: 256.8\n      mean_predicted: 222.6\n      std_predicted: 40.1\n      ve_ratio_converged_predicted: 0.55-0.65\n    civo_trigger:\n      seed0_eval_final_predicted: 45.3\n      seed0_nve_peak_predicted: 5.62\n      seed0_collapse_predicted: true\n      seed1_eval_final_predicted: 123.8\n      seed1_nve_peak_predicted: 2.31\n      seed1_collapse_predicted: false\n      seed2_eval_final_predicted: 31.7\n      seed2_nve_peak_predicted: 7.84\n      seed2_collapse_predicted: true\n      cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x_predicted: 3/3\n      cross_seed_collapse_rate_predicted: 2/3\n    no_dt_emb:\n      seed0_eval_final_predicted: 72.5\n      seed0_nve_peak_predicted: 0.31\n      seed1_eval_final_predicted: 58.3\n      seed1_nve_peak_predicted: 0.25\n      seed2_eval_final_predicted: 84.1\n      seed2_nve_peak_predicted: 0.38\n      cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x_predicted: 0/3\n      vs_baseline_predicted: 32.2%\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, Hopper Hop 是 P2 额外验证——论文叙事不依赖它, 但若完成则强化 generalization\n    claim。Hopper 是较难的 locomotion task (DreamerV3 baseline ~180-260), seed variance\n    较大 (CV ~18%) 因为 hopping 任务对 policy 细微差异更敏感。 CIVO trigger 预测遵循 Walker 模式: 3/3 NVE>1.5×,\n    2/3 collapse。 NVE severity (2-8×) 介于 Walker (2-4×) 和 Cheetah (8-70×) 之间, 反映 Hopper\n    dynamics 的中等复杂度。 No-dt-emb 预测 0/3 CIVO, eval ~32% baseline (类似 Walker/Cartpole)。\n    若完成, 跨环境 CIVO prevention 总计: Walker 0/4 + Cheetah 0/3 + PickCube 0/1 + Cartpole\n    0/3 + Hopper 0/3 = 0/14。 但 best 档审稿人已接受 3 环境足够——Hopper 是 bonus。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Hopper Hop 3×3 Summary (predicted)'\n    columns:\n    - Config\n    - Eval mean\n    - NVE>1.5× rate\n    - Collapse rate\n    - Baseline%\n    rows:\n    - - Baseline\n      - '222.6'\n      - 0/3\n      - 0/3\n      - 100%\n    - - CIVO trigger\n      - '66.9'\n      - 3/3\n      - 2/3\n      - 30.1%\n    - - No dt_emb\n      - '71.6'\n      - 0/3\n      - 0/3\n      - 32.2%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cross-environment summary: 4-5 environments × 3 configs heat map'\n  analysis: 'P2 但若完成则为论文最强 generalization evidence。\n\n    '\n- name: Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\n  plan_id: plan_060\n  description: 'P1 探索性实验: RSSM 预测不确定性超过阈值时截断 imagination rollout。 Walker Walk, dt=2,\n    1 seed。全部为预测数据。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    eval_105K_predicted: 485.3\n    nve_peak_predicted: 1.42\n    nve_105K_predicted: 0.73\n    collapse_predicted: false\n    civo_prevented_predicted: true\n    vs_baseline_predicted: 53.0%\n    effective_horizon_mean_predicted: 9.2\n    effective_horizon_std_predicted: 3.4\n    truncation_trigger_rate_predicted: 38% of rollout steps\n    value_calibration_predicted: moderate underestimation (NVE 0.6-0.8×)\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, uncertainty-gated truncation 是 Intervention Hierarchy\n    的潜在第四层 (Model-based gating)。预测它部分有效: NVE 保持 <1.5× (CIVO technically prevented),\n    但 eval 仅 53% baseline (truncation 过于激进, 缩短了有效 imagination horizon)。 这类似于 TCN 的困境:\n    足以阻止 CIVO 的干预强度也损害了学习。 Truncation rate 38% 表明 RSSM 在相当多的 rollout steps 上不确定——这本身\n    就是 RSSM fidelity gap 的直接度量。 审稿人可能将此视为 \"interesting pilot but needs more investigation\"——P1\n    定位合理, 不会升级为论文核心贡献, 但为 future work 提供了具体方向。 如果添加到 Intervention Hierarchy: L4 (Model-based):\n    Uncertainty truncation 1/1 prevents CIVO but 53% eval retention. 与 L3 TCN (2/8,\n    45-91% retention) 互补: 不同机制, 类似 trade-off。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Uncertainty-Gated Truncation Pilot'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Value\n    - Comparison\n    rows:\n    - - Eval@105K\n      - '485.3'\n      - 53% baseline (vs TCN σ=0.2 68%)\n    - - NVE_peak\n      - '1.42'\n      - Below 1.5× threshold\n    - - Mean effective horizon\n      - 9.2/15\n      - Truncation reduces useful imagination\n    - - Truncation trigger rate\n      - 38%\n      - RSSM uncertain at 38% of steps\n  figures_description:\n  - Effective horizon over training + NVE trajectory, showing truncation → NVE suppression\n  analysis: 'Pilot 结果支持 \"CIVO prevention ↔ learning quality trade-off\" 的系统性发现。 可选添加到\n    Intervention Hierarchy 作为 L4, 但非论文核心。\n\n    '\n- name: 'Aggregate: Intervention Hierarchy Final Table'\n  plan_id: aggregate_intervention_hierarchy\n  description: '论文核心 Table: 所有干预方法的系统性评估汇总。整合 C7 + C8 全部数据。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_seeds_tested: 42\n    total_methods: 8\n    total_levels: 3\n    total_environments: 3\n    overall_CIVO_prevention_rate: 4/36 (11.1%) — excluding embedding removal control\n    embedding_removal_rate: 8/8 (100%) — removes the feature entirely\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, Intervention Hierarchy 被认可为系统性贡献。审稿人看到的是: 8 种方法, 3 个干预层级,\n    3 个环境, 42 seeds——这是该类问题的首次系统性评估。 关键 narrative: 论文不是 \"我们试了一个方法失败了\", 而是 \"我们系统性地探索了\n    整个干预空间, 发现 CIVO fundamentally hard to mitigate through post-hoc interventions\"。\n    Gradient level (L1) 失败因为 forward-pass damage 不可逆; Output level (L2) 失败因为 EMA anchor\n    被污染; Representation level (L3) 在最优条件下偶尔成功但不可靠。 唯一 100% 有效的方法是移除 feature 本身——这不是\n    intervention, 是 surrender。 这为 future work 提供了明确方向: 需要 architectural solutions\n    (THICK/Hieros 式分层时间抽象), 而非 post-hoc patches。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table (论文核心): Intervention Hierarchy'\n    columns:\n    - Level\n    - Method\n    - Success rate\n    - Best eval retention\n    - Primary failure mechanism\n    rows:\n    - - L1 Gradient\n      - Full SGS\n      - 0/3\n      - 49%\n      - Forward-pass damage irreducible\n    - - L1 Gradient\n      - Obs-decoder SGS\n      - 1/6\n      - 79% (but critic destroyed)\n      - Compensatory amplification\n    - - L1 Gradient\n      - Reward SGS\n      - 0/2\n      - 36%\n      - No-op (gradient ≠ causality)\n    - - L2 Output\n      - RAVE ceil=2.0\n      - 0/1\n      - 3%\n      - EMA anchor pollution\n    - - L2 Output\n      - RAVE ceil=1.5\n      - 0/1\n      - 8%\n      - EMA anchor pollution\n    - - L3 Representation\n      - TCN σ=0.2\n      - 2/8*\n      - 91%/45% (high variance)\n      - Dose insufficient in complex envs\n    - - L3 Representation\n      - TCN σ=0.5\n      - 0/3\n      - 40%\n      - Overdose (Walker) / Underdose (Cheetah)\n    - - L3 Representation\n      - TCN σ=1.0\n      - 1/1†\n      - 27%\n      - Learning destroyed by noise\n    - - '**Control**'\n      - '**dt_emb removal**'\n      - '**8/8**'\n      - '**15-37%**'\n      - '**(removes feature)**'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Intervention Hierarchy pyramid visualization with success rates'\n  - '* 2/8 includes Walker-only σ=0.2 success; cross-env 0/4'\n  - '† Cheetah σ=1.0: technically prevents CIVO (NVE<0.21) but eval 27% → noise destroys\n    learning'\n  analysis: '论文最重要的 contribution table。Best 档审稿人将此视为 \"systematic negative results\n    that save the community significant wasted effort\"。\n\n    '\n- name: 'Aggregate: NVE Cross-Environment Classification'\n  plan_id: aggregate_nve_classification\n  description: 'NVE≥1.5× 诊断标记跨环境汇总。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    walker_trained_above_1.5x: 5/5 (008d s0-s4)\n    walker_untrained_above_1.5x: 0/7 (008f s0-s4 + 008a s0-s2)\n    cheetah_trained_above_1.5x: 3/3 (010b s0-s1 + predicted s2)\n    cheetah_untrained_above_1.5x: 0/5 (024b s0-s1 + 008a_cheetah s0-s1 + predicted)\n    pickcube_trained_above_1.5x: 1/1 (019b)\n    pickcube_untrained_above_1.5x: 0/0 (no control run)\n    total_AUROC: 0.969\n    total_sensitivity: 0.93\n    total_specificity: 0.97\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下, NVE 跨环境分类汇总是论文 C2 的 capstone evidence。 Trained dt_emb\n    → NVE>1.5× 在 9/9+ 个 independent observations 中成立 (部分 seeds 共享 seed number, 需去重)。Untrained\n    → 0/12+ 超过 1.5×。 AUROC 0.969 在 4 环境 29 data points 上成立, 尽管是 in-sample。 审稿人接受 NVE≥1.5×\n    作为 \"reliable early-warning diagnostic for CIVO risk in temporal-abstraction world-model\n    RL\", 建议 held-out validation 作为 future work。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: NVE Cross-Environment Summary'\n    columns:\n    - Environment\n    - Trained dt_emb NVE>1.5×\n    - Untrained NVE>1.5×\n    - Max NVE (trained)\n    rows:\n    - - Walker Walk\n      - 5/5\n      - 0/7\n      - 4.12×\n    - - Cheetah Run\n      - 3/3\n      - 0/5\n      - 70.64×\n    - - PickCube\n      - 1/1\n      - —\n      - 3.78×\n    - - '**Total**'\n      - '**9/9**'\n      - '**0/12**'\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Box plot: NVE distributions by condition (trained vs untrained) across environments'\n  analysis: NVE 诊断方法的 cross-environment robustness confirmation。\n","numLines":1399,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1399}}}
