{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UcPh4qwbbBziuKGBvHsiH7","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_9/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-20\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| exp_031_tcn_pickcube_s0_sigma02 | TCN (Temporal Conditioning Noise, σ=0.2) on dt_embedding during imagination rollout will suppress CIVO in ManiSkill PickCube-v1, as it did in Walker Walk, by preventing the world model from overfitting to fixed dt signals. | — | — | — |\\\\n| exp_030c_tcn_cheetah_s0_sigma10 | TCN σ=1.0 on Cheetah tests whether higher noise amplitude further suppresses CIVO. σ=0.5 (exp_030b) was negative with NVE peaking at 10.67@55K then declining. σ=1.0 should provide stronger temporal regularization. If NVE stays below 1.5 throughout training and eval_return ≥ baseline → TCN generalizes to Cheetah with appropriate σ scaling. | — | — | — |\\\\n| exp_029c_tcn_walker_s0_sigma01 | σ=0.1 tests the lower bound of effective TCN noise; if Walker σ=0.2 prevents CIVO and σ=0.1 does not, establishes minimum effective dose. Same CIVO-inducing config (gate_fixed_dt=2, subsample_max_dt=2, imag_horizon=8). Three-point dose-response: σ=0.1 (this), σ=0.2 (success), σ=0.5 (oscillatory failure). | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- exp_029d_tcn_walker_s3_sigma02（准备中）\\\\n- exp_029b_tcn_walker_s2_sigma02: TCN σ=0.2 seed variance characterization: s0 eval=91%, s1 eval=45%. Third seed resolves whether high variance is systematic or s1 is outlier.（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp_029a_tcn_walker_s1_sigma02** (success): TCN σ=0.2 multi-seed validation (seed=1): replication of exp_027_tcn_walker_s0_sigma02 which shows NVE<1.0× and eval reaching baseline at 135K. Tests whether CIVO suppression is reproducible across seeds. Same CIVO-inducing config (gate_fixed_dt=2, subsample_max_dt=2, imag_horizon=8) with TCN noise σ=0.2. If s1 also shows NVE<1.0× → TCN σ=0.2 is a robust intervention. ← 基于 exp_027_tcn_walker_s0_sigma02\\\\n- **exp_030b_tcn_cheetah_s0_sigma05** (negative): Cheetah CIVO intensity requires higher TCN noise; σ=0.5 may be the environment-appropriate dose (Walker σ=0.5 = overdose causing oscillatory CIVO, Cheetah σ=0.2 = underdose with NVE 1.903@55K). Tests whether TCN effectiveness is environment-dependent with σ scaling to CIVO severity. If NVE<1.5× and eval maintained → TCN is generalizable with environment-tuned σ.\\\\n- **exp_027_tcn_walker_s1** (negative): TCN σ=0.5 seed=1: Replication of exp_027_tcn_walker_s0 with different seed to verify that the NVE self-correction phenomenon (transient CIVO at 55K → NVE recovery to 0.83 by 75K) is reproducible across seeds, not a stochastic artifact. Same CIVO-inducing config (gate_fixed_dt=2, subsample_max_dt=2, imag_horizon=8) with TCN noise σ=0.5. ← 基于 exp_027_tcn_walker_s0\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 41 / 负向 24 / 失败 11 / 共 97\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nbjb1-40020: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1\\\\nbjb1-45299: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- exp_002_event_gated: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_006: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008a: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008c: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008d: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008e_subsample_on_fixed_dt1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008e_subsample_on_dt1_h15: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008e_v2_subsample_on_dt1_h15: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_009d_baseline_walker_s1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_009f_008f_walker_s1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_017_subsample_off_trained_dt_emb: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_016_sgs_walker_s1: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_009g_008f_walker_s0: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_009h_008f_walker_s0: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_016b_sgs_walker_s1: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_016c_sgs_walker_s1: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_016d_sgs_walker_s1: 训练失败 — un